<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mark'k'oossa Mishiraachchuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mark'k'oossi S'aafeedda Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark'k'oossa Mishiraachchuwaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mark'k'oossi S'aafeedda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mishiraachchuwaa K'aalaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark'k'oossi s'aafeedda mishiraachchuu koyro doommiiddikka, «Hawe S'oossaa Na'aa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaw doometsaa» yaagee. Ha mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa giddon Yesuusi oosuwaa asanne maatay de'iyaa asaa gidiide shiik'eedda. Yesuusa maatay Aa timirttiyaan, s'alahiyaa c'itaa bolla aw de'iyaa wolk'k'aaninne asaa nagaraa atto giyaawaan be'etteedda. Yesuusi, «Taani Asaa Na'ay yeeddawe, asaa, nagaraa ayiletetsaappe la"a kessanaw ta de'uwaa aatsaade immanaassa» yaagiide I bare huup'ew haasayeedda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark'k'oossi Yesuusa taarikiyaa suurenne wolk'k'aa kumeedda ogiyaan odeedda. I gaanaw koyyo k'ofaykka Yesuusa k'aalaanne timirttiyaa gidennaan I ootseedda maalalissiyaa oosatuwaa bollana. S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa taarikiyaa, Yesuusa s'ink'k'ataanne paac'iyaa k'antsaan erissi simmiide, Yesuusa timirttiyaanne patsuwaabaa aassiide odeedda. Wodiyaappe guyyiyaan Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu Aa loytsi eri beeddawaa keena aanana ek'ettiyaawanttu Aa loytsi is's'eeddino. Wurssetsaa shemppatuu Yesuusa de'uwaan wurssetsaa saaminttaa giddon poletteedda oosatuwaa; hewanttukka Aa kak'k'etsaabaanne Aa dendduwaabaa odiyaawantta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark'k'oossa mishiraachchuwaa wurssetsaan k'inifiyaa giddon de'iyaa <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref></char> paydatuu Geeshsha K'aalaa itti itti biletsaa s'alalaan de'iyaawantta.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Mishiraachchuwaa doometsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi oosuwaa Galiilaan doommeeddawaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14—9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi Yerusaalamen ootsowaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusaalameninne izi yuushshuwaan Yesuusa wurssetsaa saaminttaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11:1—15:47</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa Yesuusa dendduwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hayk'uwaappe denddeedda Godaa k'onc'c'etsaanne saluwaa buussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa Awaayuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk'. 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>S'oossaa Na'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'oossaa Na'aa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beni S'aafetteedda itti itti biletsaan hawe baawa.</char></note> Yesuusi Kiristtoosa wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa doometsaa.<verse eid="MRK 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Nabiyaa Isiyaasi s'aafeedda Mas'aafan S'oossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Be'a; ta kiittiyaawaa taani neeppe sintsaw yeddana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">I new ogiyaa kessanawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Itti bitanii biittaa bazzuwaan bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‹Godaa ogiyaa giigissite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">I hamettana loossuwaakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">aw suurissite› geeddawaadan»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 1:3">haneedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisi asaa s'ammak'iiddinne, «S'oossay hintte nagaraa atto gaana mala, hinttenttu nagaraappe simmiide s'ammak'ettite» yaagi k'aalaa odiidde biittaa bazzuwaan kesi wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Yihudaa gadiyaan de'iyaa Asay ubbaynne Yerusaalame katamaa Asay ubbay Yohaannisakko yeeddino. Barenttu nagaraakka paas'ina, Yohaannisi he asaa Yorddaanoosa Shaafaan s'ammak'eedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yohaannisi gaaluwaa isikiyaappe dadetteedda mayuwaa mayyiide, bare s'eessan dafuwaa danc'c'eedda; k'ay booliyaanne wora eessaa meedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Kat. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Yohaannisi k'aalaa odiidde, «Taappe guyyenna daro minniyaawe yee; haray atto, Aa c'aammaakka gediyaappe kessa tookkanaw taani bessikke. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Taani hinttentta haatsaan s'ammak'ay; shin I hinttentta Geeshsha Ayyaanan s'ammak'anawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi S'ammak'etteeddawaanne Paac'etteeddawaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk'. 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Yesuusi he wode Galiilaa gadiyaan de'iyaa Naazireete katamaappe yiina, Yohaannisi Yorddaanoosa Shaafaan Aa s'ammak'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Yesuusi haatsaappe kesosaanna saluu dooyettishiinanne Geeshsha Ayyaanay bare bolla harap'p'iyaadan wod'd'ishin be'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>K'ay saluwaappe, «Taani siik'iyaa ta Na'ay neena; taana nebay nashechchee» yaagiyaa k'aalay sisetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Dom. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mar. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk'. 3:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Ellekka Geeshsha Ayyaanay Asay bayinna mela sa'aa Aa yeddeedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Yesuusi Asay bayinna saan barena Sees'aanay paac'c'ishshin, oytamu gallassaa gatseedda; du'aannakka de'eedda; kiitanchchatuukka yiide, aw ootseeddino.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Moliyaa Oyk'k'iyaa Oyddu Asatuwaa S'eeseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat. 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk'. 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Yohaannisi k'ashettowaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi S'oossaa kawutetsaa wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odiidde, Galiilaa gadiyaa biide, <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>«Wodii gakkeedda; S'oossaa kawutetsaykka matatteedda. Hinttenttu nagaraappe simmiide, wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa ammanite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Yesuusi Galiilaa Abbaa lank'k'iyaanna aad'd'iidde, moliyaa oyk'k'iyaawantta, Simoonanne Aa ishaa Inddiraasa, barenttu dabbaa abbaan yeggiyaawantta be'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yaatiide unttuntta, «Taana kaallite; taani hinttentta moliyaa oyk'k'iyaawaadan asaa taakko ahiyaa ogiyaa tamaarissana» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan unttunttu ellekka barenttu dabbaa aggiide, Yesuusa kaalleeddino.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Yesuusi guutsaa sintsawukko biide, Zabddiyoosa naanaa laa"u ishatuwaa, Yaak'oobanne Yohaannisa wonggiriyaa giddon barenttu dabbaa giigissiyaawantta be'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>I be'osankka unttuntta s'eesina, barenttu aawuwaa, Zabddiyoosa, Aa oosanchchatuwanna wonggiriyaa giddon aggiide, Yesuusa kaalliide beeddino.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iita Ayyaanay Oyk'k'eedda Bitanii Pas'eedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk'. 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Unttunttu K'ifirinaahooma geetettiyaa katamaa yiide geleeddino; Yesuusi Sambbata gallassay gakko wode, Ayihuda woosa golle geliide, tamaarissuwaa doommi aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Barew maatay de'iyaa asaadan, asaa I tamaarissiyaawaappe attin, higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttudan tamaarissenna diraw, Asay Aa timirttiyaan maalaletteedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>He wode iita ayyaanay de'iyaa itti bitanii Ayihuda woosa golle gelosaannakka bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>«Naazireetiyaa Yesuusaa, Neeni nuuppe ayaa koyyay? Nuuna d'ayissanaw yaad? Neeni oonentto eray; neeni S'oossaappe kiitetteedda geeshsha gidikkii!» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesuusi he iita ayaanaa, «Hayzza; bitaniyaappe kesa» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Iita ayyaanay bitaniyaa buc'ereetsi, darii waasissiide, aappe kesi aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Asay ubbay maalalettiide, «Hawe ayee? Ha bitanii bare maattaani haray atto, iita ayyaanatuwaakka azazeedda; unttunttukka k'ay aw azazettiino; hawe aybe ooratsa timirttee?» yaagiide, bare giddon ittuu ittuwaa oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Galiilaa gadiyaan de'iyaa heeray ubbay ellekka Yesuusa waariyaa siiseeddino.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Daro Hargganchchatuwaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk'. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Yesuusi Ayihuda woosa golliyaappe kesosaan, Yaak'oobannanne Yohaannisanna ittippe Simoonanne Inddiraasa soy bi aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Simoona bollotatta k'os'uwaa harggaade giseeddawunnibaa I yaa gakkosaannakka aw odi aggeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>I izikko shiik'iide, izi kushiyaa oyk'k'iide, izo dentsi esseedda; k'os'uu izo aggina, iza unttunttoo ootsaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Harggeedda asaa ubbaanne iita ayyaanatuu oyk'k'eedda asaa ubbaa omarssi away wulleeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Asay aakko aheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Katamaan de'iyaa Asay ubbay he kariyaa shiik'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Yesuusi dumma dumma harggiyaan oyk'etteedda c'ora asaa patsiide, c'ora s'alahatuwaakka kesseedda. I Kiristtoosa gidiyaawaa iita ayyaanatuu ereedda diraw, unttuntta haasayissennaan diggeedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Galiilaan Tamaarisseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk'. 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Yesuusi guura wonttumaatsaan denddiide, soyippe kesiide, Asay baynnasaa biide yaan S'oossaa woosseedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simooninne aanana de'iyaawanttu Aa koyyiidde beeddino. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Unttunttu Aa demmiide, «Asay ubbay neena koyyee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Hewaappe guyye Yesuusi k'ay unttuntta, «Hewaa heeraan de'iyaa hara katamatuwaa boytte; taani hewaan k'aalaa odanaw bessee; ayaw gooppe, taani yeeddawe hewaassa» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Ayihuda woosa golletuwaan k'aalaa odiiddinne iita ayyaanatuwaa kesiide, Galiilaa gadiyaa ubbaa yuuyyeedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Oolluu Oyk'k'eedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-17">Luk'. 5:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Oolluu oyk'k'eedda itti bitanii Yesuusakko yiide, Aa sintsan gulbbatiide, «Neeni koyyooppe, taana geeshsha patsanaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Taana geeshsha patsa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay, ha harggii k'ofetteeddawe laamettanaw danddayenna eretteedda gade wogaanne maaraan, hara asaa k'ofaan itti Asay geeshsha gidenna gaana mala odiyaawaa.</char></note> danddayaa» yaagiide woosseedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesuusi aw k'aretteedda; bare kushiyaa yeddi, Aa bochchiide, «Taani koyyay; geeyya; pas'a!» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Ellekka oolluu bitaniyaa yeddi aggina, bitanii geeyyi pas'i aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesuusi darii hank'k'ettiide, ellekka Aa kessi yeddeedda. <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>I bitaniyaa, «Neena era! Hawaa oossinne odoppa; shin baade ne bollaa k'eesaa bessa; k'ay neeni ha"i geeshsha gideeddawaa asaa erissanaw, Muse azazeedda yarshshuwaa yarshsha» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Shin bitanii biide, yewuwaa ubba saan asaa ubbaw oduwaanne laaletsaa doommeedda; hewaa diraw, Yesuusi k'onc'c'iyaa kesiide, katamaa gelanaw danddayibeenna; shin Asay bayinnasaa gas'aan de'eedda; k'ay Asay ubba saappe aakko yeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bollay Sileedda Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk'. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Amareeda gallassaappe guyyiyaan, «Yesuusi K'ifirinaahooma guyye simmiide, soyin de'ee» giyaa haasayay sisetteedda. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Gollii akkenaan is's'ina, haray atto, kariikka un"ana gakkanaw c'ora Asay shiik'eedda; hewanttoo Yesuusi k'aalaa odee. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Oyddu asatuu bollay sileedda itti bitaniyaa tookkiide, aakko aheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Asay c'oreedda diraw, bitaniyaa Yesuusakko afanaw unttunttoo danddayettennan is's'ina, Yesuusi de'iyaa baggana golliyaa k'aariide, kaaraa lukkeeddino; he lukkeeddasaanna bitaniyaa I giseedda shanchchamaanna duge wotseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesuusi unttunttu ammanuwaa be'iide, he bollay sileedda bitaniyaa, «Ta na'aw, ne nagaray atto geetetteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttuppe hewaan utteedda ittuu ittuu barenttu wozanaan, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>«Laa ha bitanii hawaa mala iitabaa S'oossaa bolla ayaw haasayii? S'oossaa s'alalaappe attin, haray oonee nagaraa atto gaanaw danddayiyaawe?» yaagiide k'oppeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Unttunttu barenttu wozanaan hewaadan k'oppowaa Yesuusi ellekka bare ayyaanan eriide, unttuntta «Hinttenttu hintte wozanaan ayaw hewaadan k'oppiitee? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Bollay sileedda bitaniyaa, ‹Ne nagaray atto geetetteedda› giyaawe mateeyee? Woy, ‹Dendda ek'k'aade ne shanchchamaa tookkaade hametta› giyaawe matee? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Shin taani, Asaa Na'aw, sa'aa bollan nagaraa atto gaanaw maatay de'iyaawaa taani hinttentta erissana» yaagiide he bollay sileedda bitaniyaa, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>«Neena gay; dendda ek'k'a; yaataade ne shanchchamaa tookkaade ne soy ba» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Bitanii ellekka denddi ek'k'iide, bare shanchchamaa tookkiide, Asay ubbay s'eellishshin biina Asay ubbay maalalettiide, «Nuuni hawaa malabaa ubbakka be'i erokko» yaagiide S'oossaa galateeddino.<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Leewiyaa S'eeseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk'. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesuusi gujjikka Galiilaa Abbaa doonaa beedda; Asay ubbay aakko yeeddawantta tamaarisseedda. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Hewaanna aad'd'iidde, Ilppiyoosa na'aa Leewiyaa, giyaawe k'aras'aa k'ans's'iyaa saan utteeddawaa demmiide, «Taana kaala» yaageedda. Hewaappe guyye Leewii denddi ek'k'iide, Aa kaalleedda.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Yesuusi k'umaa maanaw Leewiyaa soyin utteedda wode, k'aras'aa akkiyaa c'ora asaynne nagaranchchatuu aanananne Aa kaalliyaawanttunna ittippe utteeddino. Aa kaalliyaawanttu giddon hewanttu mala asatuu dareeddino. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaa itti itti Parisaawatuu Yesuusi nagaranchchatuwaannanne k'aras'aa akkiyaawanttunna k'umaa miishshin be'iide, «I ayaw nagaranchchatuwaannanne k'aras'aa akkiyaawanttunna k'umaa mii?» yaagiide, Aa kaalliyaawantta oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesuusi unttunttu giyaawaa sisiide, «Hargganchchatuwaappe attin, pas'a asaw aakimii koshshenna; taani nagaranchchatuwaa s'eesanaw yeeddawaappe attin, s'illatuwaa s'eesanaw yabeykke» yaagiide unttunttoo zaareedda.<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oomaabaa Eranaw Shiik'eedda Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk'. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>S'ammak'k'iyaa Yohaannisa kaalliyaawanttunne Parisaawatuu s'oomiino; amareeda asatuu Yesuusakko yiide, «Yohaannisa kaalliyaawanttunne Parisaawatuwaa kaalliyaawanttu s'oomiino; shin neena kaalliyaawanttu ayaw s'oomikkinoo?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesuusi unttuntta «Bullachchaa yeedda asatuu machchatto akkiyaawe barenttuna de'ishshin, s'oomanaw danddayiinoo? Machchatto akkiyaawe unttunttunna de'ishshin, s'oomanaw danddaykkino. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Shin machchatto akkiyaawaa unttunttu matappe afana wodii yaanawaa; unttunttu he wode s'oomanawantta.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>«Ec'a mayuwaa bolla ooratsa d'efiyaa wotsi sikkiyaa Asay baawa; ec'aa wotsi sikkooppe, ooratsa d'efii ec'a mayuwaa peed'ereetsee; peed'etsaykka koyrowaappe darana. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>K'ay ho"o woyniyaa eessaa ec'a ogoruwaan naa"iyaa Asay baawa; shin naa"ooppe, he woyniyaa eessay ogoruwaa daakkee; barewukka woofettee; ogoruukka bayee; shin ho"o woyniyaa eessaa ooratsa ogoruwaan naa'ettee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sambbataabaa Eranaw Shiik'eedda Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk'. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Yesuusi itti Sambbata gallassi tisha banggaa giddonna aad'd'ishshin, Aa kaalliyaawanttunna aanana biidde, banggaa tishaappe duusaa doommeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Zar. 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Parisaawatuu Yesuusa, «Be'a; neena kaalliyaawanttu Sambbata gallassi higge gidennabaa ayaw ootsiinoo?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Daawite koshattiide, miyaabaa koyyeedda wode, barenanna de'iyaawanttunna ootseeddawaa ubbakka nabbabi beykkitee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Abiyaataari k'eesatoo ubbatoo kaappo gideedda wode, Daawite S'oossaa golliyaa geliide, k'eesatuwaa s'alalay maanaappe attin, ooninne maanaw higge gidennawaa Godaa sintsan wotseedda k'umaa miide, barenanna de'iyaawanttookka immeedda» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Wog. 24:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>K'aykka Yesuusi unttuntta, «Sambbatay asaw med'etteeddawaappe attin, Asay Sambbataw med'ettibeenna. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Hewaa diraw, taani, Asaa Na'ay, haray atto, Sambbatawukka Godaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kushii Sileedda Bitaniyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk'. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Yesuusi Ayihuda woosa golliyaa shirettikka geleedda; hewaan kushii sileedda itti bitanii de'ee. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Itti itti Asay Yesuusa mootanaw koyyiide, kushii sileedda bitaniyaa Sambbataan I patsooppe be'anaw naagee. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesuusi he kushii sileedda bitaniyaa, «Dendda ek'k'aade sintsaw haaya» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan asaa, «Sambbataan lo"obaa ootsiyaawe wogeeyye iitabaa ootsiyaawe wogee? Asaa shemppuwaa ashshiyaawe wogeeyye wod'iyaawe wogee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Shin Asay c'o"u geedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Yesuusi hank'k'ettiide, unttuntta yuushshi aatsi s'eelliide, unttunttu odina sisennawantta gidiyaa diraw, unttunttoo darii kayyotteedda; he bitaniyaa, «Ne kushiyaa piddi ootsa» yaageedda; bitanii piddi ootsina, Aa kushii pas'i aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Parisaawatuu Ayihuda woosa golliyaappe kare kesiide, Yesuusa wooti wod'anentto Heroodisanna de'iyaawanttunna mak'k'eteeddino.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asay Abbaa Lank'k'iyaan Yesuusakko Shiik'eeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna Galiilaa Abbaa beedda; Galiilaappe c'ora Asay Aa kaalleedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>K'aykka c'ora Asay Yihudaappe, Yerusaalameppe, Eedomiyaasappe, Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsa baggappe, S'iiroosa katamaappenne Sidoonaa katamaappe Yesuusi ootseeddawaa sisiide, aakko yeedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Yesuusi c'ora Asay barena sugi un"etsenna mala, barena kaalliyaawantta wonggiriyaa barew gam"etsana mala azazeedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Daro asaa I patseedda diraw, harggiyaa Asay ubbay Aa bochchanaw sugerettee. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Iita ayyaanay de'iyaa asatuukka Aa be'eedda wode ubbaan Aa sintsan guufanniide, barenttu k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Neeni S'oossaa Na'aa gidikkii!» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Yesuusi he iita ayyaanatuu barebaa asaw odiide, barena k'onc'c'iyaa kessenna mala, unttuntta minisiide azazeedda.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Kiittiyaawantta Dooreedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk'. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Yesuusi deriyaa bolla kesiide, bare koyyeedda asatuwaa barekko s'eeseedda; hewaappe guyye aakko beeddino. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14-15"/>Unttunttu barenanna de'ana malanne k'aalaa odanaw unttuntta kiittana mala, iita ayyaanatuwaa asaappe kessanaw unttunttoo maatay de'ana mala, tammanne laa"u asatuwaa dooreedda.<verse eid="MRK 3:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>I dooreedda tammanne laa"atuu hawantta: P'es'iroosa yaagiide suntseedda Simoona, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Bo'aanerggeessa yaagiide suntseedda Zabddiyoosa naanaa Yaak'oobanne Yaak'ooba ishaa Yohaannisa. «Bo'aanerggeessa» giyaawe «Wolk'k'aama asatuwaa» giyaawaa. <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Inddiraasanne Pilip'p'oosa, Barttalamoosanne Maatoossa, Toomaasanne Ilppiyoosa na'aa Yaak'ooba, Taadoosanne bare biittaw seelettiyaa Simoona, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Yesuusa aatsi immeedda Yihudaa Ask'k'oroota.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:10">14:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Bi'eel-Zebuula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat. 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk'. 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Yesuusi soy beedda; laa'entsuwaakka k'ay c'ora Asay shiik'ina, inne Aa kaalliyaawanttunna haray atto, k'umaa maanawukka danddaybbeykkino; <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>asay Aa, «Gooyee» giyaa diraw, Aa dabbattuu hewaa sisiide, Aa akkanaw beeddino.<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaa itti itti asatuu Yerusaalameppe yiide, «Yesuusa bolla Bi'eel-Zebuuli de'ee» yaageeddino; k'ay, «S'alahatuwaa kaappuu barew wolk'k'aa immina, iita ayyaanatuwaa kessee» yaagiide haasayeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesuusi asaa barekko s'eesiide, leemisuwaa odiidde, «Sees'aanay Sees'aanaa wooti kessanaw danddayi? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Itti kawutetsay bare giddon shaakettooppe, he kawutetsay ek'k'anaw danddayenna; <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>k'ay itti golle asaykka bare giddon shaakettooppe, he golle asaykka ek'k'anaw danddayenna. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Sees'aanay barenanna walak'ettiide shaakettooppe, bayanaappe attin, de'ana danddayenna.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>«Shin wolk'k'aama asaa golle geliide kasetiide Aa k'achchennaan de'iidde, Aa miishshaa bonk'k'anaw danddayiyaa Asay baawa; k'achcheeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Aa golliyaa bonk'k'anaw danddayee.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>«Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; S'oossay asaa naanaw nagaraa ubbaanne unttunttu boriyaa boriyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Boriyaa boriyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay S'oossaa bollan Asay haasayiyaa iita, balanne geella haasayaa.</char></note> ubbaa atto gaana; <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>shin Geeshsha Ayaanaa bolla iita boriyaa haasayiyaa oossinne med'inaw nagaraa gidanaappe attin, S'oossay ubbakka atto geena» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk'. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yesuusi hewaa geeddawe, itti itti asatuu, «Yesuusa bolla iita ayyaanay de'ee» yaageedda diraassa.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Daayonne Ishatuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk'. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Yesuusa daayanne Aa ishatuu yiide, karen ek'k'i aakko asaa kiittiide, Aa s'eesisseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>C'ora Asay Aa matan utteeddino; he kiitetteeddawe Aa, «Be'a; ne daayanne ne ishatuu karen ek'k'iide, neenanna gakettanaw koyyiino» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ta daaya oonee? K'ay ta ishatuu oonee?» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Bare matan utteedda asaa yuushshi aatsi s'eelliide, «Be'ite; ta daayanne ta ishatuu hawanttushi. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>S'oossay koyyiyaawaa ootsiyaa ubbay ta ishaa, ta michchatonne ta daayo» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Zeretsaa Zeriyaawaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk'. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yesuusi shirettikka Galiilaa Abbaa mataan tamaarissuwaa doommeedda; c'ora Asay bare miyyiyaan yuuyyi aad'd'iide shiik'i uttina, abbaan de'iyaa wonggiriyaa giddo geliide, aan utteeddino; k'ay he Asay ubbay abbaa miyyiyaan de'ee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk'. 5:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>I unttuntta darobaa leemisuwaan tamaarissiidde,<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>«Sisite; itti bitanii zeretsaa zeranaw keseedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>I zerishshin, itti itti zeretsay ogiyaa doonaan wod'd'eedda; hewaa kafuu yiide meedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Itti itti zeretsay anc'c'o biittaa bolla wod'd'eedda; daro biittay baynna diraw, he zeretsay ellekka mokkeedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Away keseedda wode shulleedda; adussa s'ap'uwaa yeddibeenna diraw, meli aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Itti itti zeretsay aguntsaa giddon wod'd'eedda; hewaan mokkeeddawaa aguntsay dic'c'iide c'uullina, ayfenaan atteedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Itti itti zeretsay tu'e biittaan zerettiide mokkeedda; dic'c'iide ittuu hattamuwaa, ittuu usuppun tammuwaa ayfina, ittuu s'eetuwaa ayfeedda.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>K'aykka Yesuusi, «Sisanaw haytsay de'iyaa uray siso» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Leemisuwaan Odeedda Gaasuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk'. 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Tammanne laa"u Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttunne I odeeddawaa siseedda hara asatuu I barekka de'ishshin aakko shiik'iide, he leemisuwaa biletsaa Aa oochcheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11-12"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo, «Hinttenttoo S'oossaa kawutetsaa s'uuraa yewuwaa eray imetteedda; shin haratuu kawutetsaappe karenna de'iyaawanttu, s'eelaa s'eelliidde be'enna mala, k'ay sissaa sisiiddikka akeekena mala, unttunttu shirettiide S'oossaakko simmina, I unttunttu nagaraa atto geena mala, unttunttoo ubbabay leemisuwaan odettee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:11-12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeriyaawaa Leemisuwaa Biletsaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat. 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk'. 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ha leemisuwaa erikkitee? Yaatina, leemisuwaa ubbaa wooti eranitee? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Zeriyaawe S'oossaa k'aalaa zeree. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>K'aalay zerettiyaa ogiyaa doonaan de'iyaawanttu hawantta; unttunttu k'aalaa sisiyaa wode, Sees'aanay ellekka yiide, unttunttu wozanaan zeretteedda k'aalaa afi diggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Hawaadankka k'ay anc'c'otiyaa biittaan zeretteeddawanttu hawantta; unttunttu k'aalaa sisiide, ellekka nashechchaan akkiino. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Unttunttu ha"iw de'iinoppe attin, unttunttoo mino s'ap'uu baawa; guyyeppe k'aalaa gaasuwaan waayyii woy yederssuu yiyaa wode, unttunttu ellekka d'ubetti aggiino. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>K'ay aguntsaa giddon zeretteeddawanttu hawantta; unttunttu k'aalaa sisiyaawantta. <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>Shin ha sa'aa de'oo hirggiyaawe duretetsaa dosiyaawenne harabaa amottiyaawe unttunttu wozanaan geliide, k'aalaa c'uullina ayfenaan atti aggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Shin tu'e biittaan zeretteeddawanttu k'aalaa sisiide akkiyaawantta; ittuu hattamuwaa, ittuu usuppun tammuwaa ayfina, ittuu s'eetuwaa ayfeedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'omppiyaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk'. 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yesuusi gujjiide, «S'omppiyaa ahiide, gillaappe woy arssaappe garssanna wotsiyaa Asay de'ii? D'ok'k'asaan wotsennee? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Ayaw gooppe, k'oseeddabay ubbay k'onc'c'iyaa kesanawaa; k'ay geeman wotseeddabay ubbay beettenaan attena. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Sisanaw haytsay de'iyaa uray de'ooppe siso» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>K'aykka unttuntta, «Hinttenttu sisiyaawaa akeekiide sisite; S'oossay hintte makkeedda k'un"aan hinttenttoo makkanawaa. I hinttenttoo darissiide immana; <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>de'iyaa uraw gujji immana; baynnawaappe haray atto, aw de'iyaa he guutsattokka akki diggana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dic'c'iyaa Zeretsaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Yesuusi k'aykka, «S'oossaa kawutetsay gaden katsaa zeriyaa asaa mala. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>He bitanii k'amma gem"ishee; guura denddee; I bare huup'ew waanintto erennaan, he zeretsay mokkeenne dic'c'ee. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Biittay katsaa barekka mokkeenne ayfee; koyro c'arshshay c'aaree; guyyeppe ayfanaw kuukumee; k'ay wurssetsaan kumentsaa ayfiyaa ayfee. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Shin katsay gakkiyaa wode, katsaa shiishshiyaa wodii gakkeedda diraw, bitanii ellekka baac'aan c'akuwaa geli aggeedda» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Iyu. 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sannaafic'iyaa Zeretsaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-34">Mat. 13:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk'. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Yesuusi, «Nuuni S'oossaa kawutetsaa ayaa malatee gaanee? Woy ayaanna leemisanee? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>S'oossaa kawutetsay sannaafic'iyaa ayfatto malatee. He ayfatta zeriyaa wode, sa'aan de'iyaa mitsaa ayfiiyaa ubbaappekka guus's'aw; <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>henno zerina mokkaade hara atakilttiyaa ubbaappe daraw; daro daashshaa daashaw. Kafuu izi k'ankkaa kuwaan golliyaa kees's'ana danddayee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yesuusi hawaa mala daro leemisuwaan Asay sisanaw danddayiyaawaa keenaa, bare k'aalaa odeedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Asaw leemisuu baynnaan odenna; shin Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttu s'alalaanna de'iyaa wode, unttunttoo ubbabaa billiide odee.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Beetaa C'o"u Ootseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk'. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>He gallassi sa'ay omarssina, Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta «Abbaappe hefintsa pinnoytte» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu asaa aggiide, Yesuusi kase geli utteedda wonggiriyaan geliide, Yesuusa barenttuna afeeddino; hara wonggiratuukka hewaan de'iino. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Wolk'k'aama gotuu denddina, beetay wonggiriyaa shoc'ina, haatsay kumana gakkanaw wonggiriyaa giddo geleedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>He wode Yesuusi wonggiriyaan guyye baggana borkkotsaa borkkotiide gem"isheedda. Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu Aa dentsiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, nuuni d'ayiyaa wode c'o"u gaade s'eellay?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>I beegottiide gotuwaa, «C'o"u ga» giide, abbaakka, «Woppu ga» geedda; gotuukka c'o"u giina, ubbabaykka woppu geedda. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta «Ayaw hawaadan yayyiitee? Hinttenttu waan ammanikkitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Unttunttu daro yayyiide barenttu giddon, «Hawe laa haray atto, gotuunne abbay azazettiyaawe oonee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Iita Ayyaanay Oyk'k'eedda <optbreak/>Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk'. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Yesuusinne Aa kaalliyaawanttu abbaappe hefintsaw pinniide, Gerggesenoona geetettiyaa gadiyaa gakkeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Asaa moogiyaa duufuu de'iyaasaappe iita ayyaanay de'iyaa itti bitanii kesiide, Yesuusi wonggiriyaappe keseedda wode, Yesuusanna gaketteedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Bitanii he duufuu de'iyaa saan ak'i peeshiide, yaan de'ee; Aa ooninne haray atto, santsalataan k'achchanawukka danddaybbeenna. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Ayaw gooppe, I daro wode uk'k'unaaninne santsalataan k'ashettiide de'ee; shin santsalataa duseretseedda; uk'k'unnaakka mentsereetseedda; Aa s'oonanaw danddayeeddawe ooninne baawa. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>I ubbaa wode gallassinne k'amma, he duufuu de'iyaasaaninne deriyaa bolla waassee; bare bollaakka shuchchaan gaaree.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Yesuusa haakuwaan be'eedda wode, aakko wos's'i yiide aw goyinneedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>He bitanii bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Ubbaappe Bolla S'oossaa Na'aw, Yesuusaa, neenanne taana ayee gatsii? Taana murenna mala, taani neena S'oossaa suntsan woossay» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>I hewaa ayaw geeddee gooppe, Yesuusi Aa, «Laa ha iita ayyaanaw, ha bitaniyaappe kesa» yaageeddawaassa.<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Ne suntsay oonee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">I, «Nuuni c'ora gidiyaa diraw, ta suntsay Leegiyoona» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Iita ayyaanatuwaa he gadiyaappe kessi yeddenna mala, Yesuusa minisiide woosseedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>He deriyaa bollan c'ora guduntsaa wudii heemettee; <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>iita ayyaanatuu Yesuusa, «Nuuna hini guduntsaa wudiyaakko yeddaarikkii; unttunttun biide gelana» yaagiide woossina, <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesuusi, «Biite» yaageedda. Iita ayyaanatuu bitaniyaappe kesiide, guduntsatuwaan geleeddino; laa"u sha"a gidiyaa guduntsaa wudii kakaa huup'iyaanna kajjottiidde, abbaan geliide, mitetti aggeedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Guduntsaa wudiyaa heemmiyaawanttu bak'atiide, haneeddawaa katamaaninne katamaappe gas'aa gadiyaan odeeddino; hewaa be'anaw Asay yeedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Asay Yesuusakko yiide, c'ora iita ayyaanatuu beni oyk'k'eedda bitanii bare wozanay simmina, mayuwaa mayyiide, hewaan utteeddawaa be'iide, ubbay yayyeedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Hewaa be'eedda asatuu iita ayyaanatuu oyk'k'eedda bitanii haneeddawaanne k'ay guduntsaa wudiyaabaa he asaw odeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Hewaa diraw, Asay barenttu gadiyaappe Yesuusi baana mala, woosaa doommeedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yesuusi wonggiriyaan gelishshin, iita ayyaanatuu oyk'k'eedda bitanii Yesuusanna de'ana mala, Yesuusa woosseedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Shin Yesuusi is's'iide Aa, «Ne soy simmaade, Goday new ay mala wolk'k'aamabaa ootseeddenttonne k'ay I new ay mala keekentto ne soy asaw oda» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Bitanii biide, Tammu Katamaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tammu Katamaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawanttu itti c'ita gideedda katamatuu Sammaariyaappenne Galiilaa gadiyaa away doliyaa baggana de'iyaawantta gidiide, hewanttun de'iyaa asatuwaa eeshshaykka Giriike asatuwaa de'uwaa ogiyaa kaalliyaawaa bessee.</char></note> giyaa saan yuuyyiide, Yesuusi barew ay mala wolk'k'aamabaa ootseeddentto, oduwaa doommeedda; I odeeddawaa siseedda Asay ubbay maalaletteedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaa'iroosa Naattonne Yesuusa Mayuwaa Bochcheedda Mishiratto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk'. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesuusi simmiide, wonggiriyaan geliide, abbaa pinneeddawaappe guyyiyaan, c'ora Asay abbaa mataan Aakko yuuyyi aad'd'iide shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Yaa'iroosa giyaawe, Ayihuda woosa golliyaa kaappatuwaappe ittuu, Yesuusa be'eedda wode aakko yi Aa gediyaan kunddiide, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>«Ta naatta harggaade hayk'k'anaw; iza pas'iide lo"o de'ana mala, yaade ne kushiyaa izi bolla wotsaarikkii» yaagiide Yesuusa minisiide woosseedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesuusi Yaa'iroosanna beedda; I biishshin c'ora Asay Aa kaalliidde metootseeddino.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Tammanne laa"u laytsaa ubbaa izi bollaappe suutsay goggiyaa itti mishiratta de'aw. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>C'ora aakimatuu izo aakimishshinkka, iza pas'a kaa'ettaaddu; bare miishshaa ubbaa wurssinakka iziw haa iiteeddawaappe attin, ayinne izo maaddibeenna. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>He mishiratta Yesuusabaa sisaade, asaa giddonna Yesuusappe guyyenna yaade, Aa mayuwaa bochchaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ayaw gooppe iza, «Taani haray atto, Aa mayuwaa bochchooppekka pas'ana» yaagaade k'oppaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Iippe goggiyaa suutsay ellekka ek'k'i aggeedda; iza bare waayiyaappe pas'eeddawaa bare bollaan eraa aggaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Yesuusi bareppe wolk'k'ay kesseeddawaa bare huup'ew eriide, ellekka c'ora asaa giddon guyye simmiide, «Ta mayuwaa bochcheeddawe oonee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu Aa, «Asay neena sugiyaa wode be'aadde, ‹Taana oonee bochcheeddawe?› yaagay?» geeddino.<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Yesuusi hewaa oonee ootseeddenttonne be'anaw yuushshi aatsiide s'eelleedda; <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>shin mishiratta barew haneeddawaa eraade, yashshaa kokkoraadde yaade Yesuusa sintsan guufannaaddu; k'ay tumatetsaan haneeddawaa ubbaa aw odaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yesuusi izo, «Ta naattee, neena ne ammanuu patseedda; saruwaan ba; ne waayiyaappenne pas'a» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Yesuusi biro hewaa giishshin, Ayihuda woosa golliyaa kaappuwaa soyippe kiitetteedda asatuu yiide, «Ne naatta hayk'k'adiggaaddu; simmi tamaarissiyaawaa ayaw daaburssay?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Shin Yesuusi unttunttu giyaawaa sisiide, Ayihuda woosa golliyaa kaappuwaa, «Ammano s'alalaa ammanappe attin, yayyoppa» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Yesuusi P'es'iroosappe, Yaak'oobappenne Yaak'ooba ishaa Yohaannisappe haray ooninne barena kaallenna mala diggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Unttunttu Ayihuda woosa golliyaa kaappuwaa soy gakkeedda wode, Yesuusi Asay loytsi yeekkiyaawaanne zilaaliyaawaa be'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Geliide asaa, «Ayaw loytsi yeekkiitee? Naatta gem"ishshaadduppe attin, hayk'k'abeykku» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Hewaappe guyye Asay Aa bolla miic'c'eedda; shin asaa ubbaa kare kessiide, naatti aawuwaanne aatto hewaan barenanna de'iyaa Aa kaalliyaawanttanne akkiide, naatta de'iyaasaa geleedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Yesuusi naatti kushiyaa oyk'k'iide, «S'aalitaa, k'uumii»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">S'aalitaa, k'uumii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalatuu Aramaayike geetettiyaa k'aalaan Yesuusa wodiyaan Paalasttiine gaden haasayettiyaawaa. S'aalitaa giyaawenne k'uumi giyaawe amaaratsuwaa k'aalaa gidenna. Shin Giriikiyaa k'aalaa.</char></note> yaageedda; hewaa biletsay, «Guutsa naattee, taani neena dendda gay» giyaawaa.<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Naatta ellekka dendda ek'k'aade hamettaaddu; iza tammanne laa"u laytsaa naatto; hewe haniyaawaan Asay daro maalaletteedda. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yesuusi hewaa unttunttu oossinne odenna mala, unttuntta minisi azaziide, «Iziw miyaabaa immite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Naazireeten Akkenaan Is's'eeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk'. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesuusi hewaappe kesiide, bare gadiyaa Naazireete katamaa beedda; Aa kaalliyaawanttukka Aa kaalliide beeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Sambbataa gallassi Ayihuda woosa golliyaan tamaarissuwaa doommeedda; I tamaarissiyaawaa siseedda c'ora Asay maalalettiide, «Hawe ha ubbabaa hak'appe demmeeddee? Ha aw imetteedda aad'd'o eratetsay ayee? S'oossay ootsiyaa malaataa I wooti ootsii?<figure style="fig" alt="Man reading inside synagogue" file="lb00244b.tif" size="col" ref="6:2">Ayihudatuwaa woosa Gollen nabbabiyaa bitaniyaa</figure> <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Hawe anaas'iyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Anaas'iyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giriike biletsaan shuchchaa woy urk'k'aa melissiide med'd'iyaa asaa giide go"ettee.</char></note> gidennee? Mayraami na'aa, Yaak'ooba ishaa, Yoosa ishaa, Yihudaa ishaa, Simoona ishaa gidennee? Aa michchatuu nuunanna hawaan de'iyaawantta gidikkinoo?» yaagiide, I giyaawaa akkenaan is's'eeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesuusi he asaw, «Nabii bare gadiyaan, bare dabbatuwaaninne barenttu soy asaan bonchchettennawaappe attin, ubba saan bonchchetee» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>I hewaan bare kushiyaa amareeda asatuwaa bolla wotsiide, unttuntta patseeddawaappe attin, c'ora malaataa ootsanaw ayinne danddaybbeenna. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Asay ammanibeenna diraw maalaletteedda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesuusi Tammanne Laa"u Barena Kaalliyaawanttu Tamaarissanaadan Kiitteedda</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk'. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi hewaa heeraan de'iyaa k'eeri katamatuwaan yuuyyi yuuyyiide, asaa tamaarisseedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Yesuusi tammanne laa"u barena kaalliyaawantta barekko s'eesiide, laa"uwaa laa"uwaa kiitteedda; k'ay unttunttoo iita ayyaanatuwaa kessiyaa maataa immeedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Unttuntta, «Ogiyaa s'am"aappe attin, k'umaa, k'arc'c'iitiyaa, hinttew miishshaa ayaanneekka oyk'k'oppite. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Hinttenttu gediyaan c'aammaakka wotsite; shin laa"u mayuwaa mayyoppite» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>K'aykka unttuntta, «Hinttentta Asay hak'an mokkooppenne, hewaappe kesana gakkanaw, he golliyaan utti aggite. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Hinttentta Asay mokkennasaa woy hintte odiyaabaa sisennasaa hak'a gidooppekka, he gadiyaan de'iyaa asaw hewe markka gidana mala, hewaappe kesiidde, hintte gediyaappe baanaa shoc'ite»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hintte gediyaappe baanaa shoc'ite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe Asay is's'eeddawaa bessiyaawaa.</char></note> yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Tammanne laa"u Aa kaalliyaawanttu biide, Asay barenttu nagaraappe simmanaadan, k'aalaa odeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Unttunttu asaappe daro iita ayyaanatuwaa kessiide, harggiyaa asaa c'ora zayitiyaa okkiide patseeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak'. 5:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk'. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Asay Yesuusa suntsaa dentsiyaa diraw, Kaatiyaa Heroodise hewaa ubbaa siseedda; itti itti asay, «S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisi hayk'uwaappe denddeedda; hewoo aw wolk'k'aama malaataa ootsiyaa wolk'k'ay de'ee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Shin haranttu Aa, «Hawe Eelaasa» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Haranttu k'ay, «Hawe beni wode nabatuwaa malatiyaa nabiyaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Shin Heroodise hewaa siseedda wode, «Hewe taani k'ood'iyaa muuc'isseedda s'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa. I hayk'uwaappe pas'eedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Ayaw gooppe, Heroodise bare ishaa Pilip'p'oosa machchatto Heroodiyaado akki wotseedda; Heroodise izi diraw, bare huup'ew asaa kiittiide, Yohaannisa oytsiide, k'ashissi wotseedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Ayaw gooppe, Yohaannisi Heroodisa, «Neeni ne ishaa machchatto akkanaw bessena» yaagi wotseedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Heroodiyaada Yohaannisaw uluwaan morkkiyaa oyk'k'aade Aa wod'isanaw koyaaddu; shin danddayabeykku. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Yohaannisi s'illo asanne geeshsha asaa gideeddawaa Heroodise ereedda diraw, aw yayyiide, loytsi naagi wotseedda; Yohaannisi giyaawaa sisiide, bare wozanaan darssi metootiiddekka aabaa nashechchaan siseedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Heroodise bare yeletteedda gallassi, gadiyaa ayissiyaawanttoo, shaalak'atoonne Galiilaan de'iyaa wolk'k'aama asaw shoobiyaa giigisseedda wode, wurssetsaan Heroodiyaada injje gallassaa demmaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Heroodiyaadi naatta imatsaa mokkiyaasaa gela duraadde, Heroodisanne Aa imatsatuwaa nashechchaaddu; Hewaappe guyye kaatii naattiw, «Neena lo"eeddawaa ayaa gidooppenne taana oochcha; taani new immana» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>K'ay iziw darii c'aak'k'iide, «Neeni oochcheeddawaa ayaa gidooppekka, taani new immana; haray atto, ta kawutetsaappe bagga gidooppekka, taani new immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Naatta kare kesaade bare daayo, «Ayaa imma goo?» yaagaade oochchaaddu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">I daaya, «S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa huup'iyaa imma ga» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Naatta ellekka kaatiyaakko baade Aa, «S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa huup'iyaa woc'iitiyaan wotsaade, neeni ha"i taw immanaadan koyyay» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Hewaappe guyye kaatii darii k'aretteedda; shin bare c'aak'uwaa dirawunne bare imatsatuwaa diraw iziw c'aak'k'eedda c'aak'uwaa kolanaw koyyibeenna. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Hewaa diraw, ellekka naagiyaawaa kiittiide, Yohaannisa huup'iyaa ahana mala azazeedda; naagiyaawe k'asho golle biide, Yohaannisa k'ood'iyaa muuc'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>He muuc'eeddawaa woc'iitiyaan wotsi ahiide, naattiw immeedda; naatta k'ay bare aattiw immaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Yohaannisa kaalliyaawanttu hewaa siseedda wode yiide, Aa anhaa afiide moogeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ichcheshu Sha"a Asaa Miziide Kalisseedda Taarikiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk'. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Yesuusi kiitteeddawanttu simmiide, Yesuusanna gakettiide, barenttu ootseeddabaanne barenttu tamaarisseeddabaa ubbaa Yesuusaw odeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Biyaa asaynne yiyaa Asay darina, haray atto k'umaa maanawukka unttuntta gatsennaan is's'eedda diraw, Yesuusi unttuntta, «Nuurekka guutsaa shemppi akkanaw Asay baynnasaa boytte»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Asay baynnasaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe Galiilaa geetettiyaa wombbaappe pudehaa dola baggana de'ee. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 6:45">6:45</ref></char> s'eellite.</note> yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Yesuusinne unttunttu barenttu s'alalaa wonggiriyaan uttiide, Asay baynnasaa beeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Unttunttu biishshin, c'ora Asay unttuntta be'iide ereedda; katamaa ubbaappe gediyaan wos's'iidde, unttunttu biyaasaa unttunttuppe kasetiide gakkeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yesuusi wonggiriyaappe kesiide, c'ora asaa be'eedda; Asay heemmiyaa Asay baynna dorssaa mala gideedda diraw, k'arettiide asaa darobaa tamaarissuwaa doommeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Pay. 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Kat. 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Od. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Hiz. 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat. 9:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Sa'ay omarssiyaa wode, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu aakko yiide, «Hawe sa'ay Asay baynna sa'aa; ha"i sa'aykka k'ammi diggeedda; <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>asay heeraanne k'eeri katamatuwaa giddo biide, barenttoo miyaabaa shammana mala, asaa moyzza» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Shin Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Asaw miyaabaa hintte immite» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Hewaappe guyye unttunttu, «Nuuni biide, laa"u s'eetu biraa santtimiyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Biraa santtimiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beni wodiyaan asaa gadiyaan itti gallassaa uniyaa ootsi peesheedda asaw itti biraa santtimii imettee. Mat. 20:2 s'eellite.</char></note> k'umaa shammiide, Asay maanaw immanee?» yaagiide Aa oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttoo aappun daabbuu de'ii? Biide be'ite» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Unttunttu be'iide, «Ichcheshu daabbuwaanne laa"u moliyaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta asaa ubbaa c'itan c'itan shaakki shaakkiide, maataan utissana mala azazeedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Asay s'eetuu s'eetuunne ishatamuu ishatamuu c'itan c'itan utteeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yesuusi ichcheshu daabbuwaanne laa"u moliyaa oyk'k'iide, pude saluwaa s'eelliide, S'oossaa galateedda; daabbotuwaa mentsiide asaw gishana mala, barena kaalliyaawanttoo immeedda; k'ay laa"u moliyaakka unttunttu ubbaw shaakkeedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Asay ubbay miide kalleeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Hewaappe guyye atteedda daabbotuwaa dokkaynne moliyaa dokkay tammanne laa"u zambbeeliyaa kumeeddawaa Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu dentseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Daabbuwaa meedda attuma Asay ichcheshu sha"a.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Abbaa Bollan Hamettiidde Beedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Ellekka Yesuusi he c'ora asaa moyzziide, barena kaalliyaawanttu wonggiriyaan geliide, abbaappe hefintsan de'iyaa Beetesayda giyaa katamaa bareppe sintsatiide baanaadan azazeedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Unttuntta moyzzeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, S'oossaa woossanaw zooziyaa keseedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Sa'ay k'ammiyaa wode wonggirii wombbaa gidduwaan de'ishshin, Yesuusi wombbaappe gas'aan barekka de'ee. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>C'arkkuu Aa kaalliyaawanttukko c'arkkiyaa diraw, barena kaalliyaawantta wombbaa beetay metootsiyaawaa Yesuusi be'iide, kuttuu waassana haniyaa wode wombbaa bollan hamettiidde, unttunttukko yeedda; unttuntta yeggi aad'd'anaw koyyeedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Shin wombbaa bollan I hamettishshin, unttunttu Aa be'iide, barenttoo moyttilliyaa malatina waasseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu ubbay Aa be'iide, yashshaa kokkoreeddino; shin ellekka Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ayinne baawa; taanattennee yayyoppite» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Yesuusi unttunttunna ittippe wonggiriyaan gelina, c'arkkuu woppu geedda; unttunttu daro maalaletteeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu wozanay jolleedda diraw, unttunttu ukitsaabaa akeekibeykkino.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Gensaarees'en Hargganchchatuwaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat. 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Unttunttu abbaa pinniide, Gensaarees'a giyaa biittaa gakkeeddino; yaan wonggiriyaa gas'aa shiishshi k'achcheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Unttunttu wonggiriyaappe wod'd'iyaawaan, Asay ellekka Yesuusa erinne <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>hewaa heeraan de'iyaa gadiyaa ubbaan wos'erettiide, hargganchchatuwaa shanchchamaan tookkiide, «Yesuusi de'ee» giina siseeddasaa ahuwaa doommeedda. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Yesuusi beedda sa'aa ubbaan k'eeri katamaan gidina, wolk'k'aama katamaan gidina, heeraa giddon gidinakka, geyaa denbbaan Asay hargganchchatuwaa aakko afee. Yesuusi bare mayuwaa mac'araa gidooppenne hargganchchatuwaa boshissana mala, Asay Aa woosseedda; bochcheedda ubbay pas'eedda.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Asaa Wogaappe Koshshennawaa P'alk'k'eedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat. 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Parisaawatuunne Yerusaalameppe yiide, Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaa amareeda asatuu Yesuusakko shiik'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu ittuu tuna kushiyan, hewaa giyaawe meec'ettennaan k'umaa miyaawantta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Meec'ettennaan k'umaa miyaawantta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihude asatuwaa wogaan meec'ettenna kushiyan k'umaa muussay tunaadan paydettee. Hewoo k'umaa maanappe kasenna kushiyaa meechchaa loytsi minisiino.</char></note> be'eeddino.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Ayaw gooppe, Parisaawatuunne Ayihuda Asay ubbay barenttu aawotuwaa wogaa naagiide, barenttu kushiyaa loytsi meec'ettennaan miikkino. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>K'ay geyaappe yiidekka meec'ettennaan de'iidde miikkino. K'ay unttunttu barenttu aawotuwaappe akkeedda hara c'ora wogay de'ee; hewekka wanc'c'aa, keriyaa, birataappe med'd'eedda miishshaanne arssaa meec'c'iyaa wogaa.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Parisaawatuunne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu Yesuusa, «Neena kaalliyaawanttu ayaw nu aawotuwaa wogaa kaallennaan is's'iide, barenttu kushiyaa meec'ettennaan k'umaa miinoo?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6-7"/>Yesuusi unttuntta hawaadan yaageedda; «Isiyaasi timbbitiyaa odeedda wode, hinttenttubaa, lo"a malatiyaa iitatubaa s'aafeeddawaadankka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6-7">« ‹S'oossay, «Hawe Asay taana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6-7">bare bolla doonaan bonchchee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6-7">Shin unttunttu wozanay taappe haakuwaan de'ee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6-7">asay taw mela goyinnee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6-7">Ayaw gooppe, Asay ootseedda azazuwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6-7">S'oossaa higgiyaa malatissiide tamaarissee» geedda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 7:6-7">yaagiide timbbitiyaa tumuwaa odeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa. 29:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>«S'oossaa azazuwaa hintte aggiide, asaa wogaa minisiide naagiita» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>K'aykka Yesuusi, «Hinttenttu hintte wogaa naaganaw S'oossaa azazuwaa aggiita. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Ayaw gooppe Muse, ‹Ne aabbanne ne daayo bonchcha› K'ay, ‹Bare aabbanne bare aatto boriyaawe hayk'uwaan muretto› yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kes. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Wog. 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Zar. 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Shin itti uraw bare aawuwaa woy bare aatto maaddiyaabay de'ishshin I, ‹Hawe k'urbbaaniyaa; hawaa guussay S'oossaabaa giyaawaa› gooppe, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>I bare aawuwaa woy bare aatto wodeppe maaddanawaa ayinne koyyikkita. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Ha hanotaan hintte hinttenttu wogaa naaganaw, S'oossaa k'aalaa koliide, hewaa mala darobaa ootsiita» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asaa Tunissiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat. 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Yesuusi c'ora asaa k'aykka barekko s'eesiide, «Ubbay taani giyaawaa sisitenne akeekite. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Asaappe kesiyaawe asaa tunissiyaawaappe attin, kareppe asaa giddo geliide, asaa tunissiyaabay ayinne baawa; <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>sisanaw haytsay de'iyaa uray ooninne siso» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Yesuusi c'ora asaa aggiide soy geleedda wode, Aa kaalliyaawanttu he leemisuwaabaa Aa oochcheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>I unttuntta, «Hinttenttookka k'ay gelibeennee? Kareppe asaa wozanaan geliyaabay ayinne asaa tunissanaw danddayennawaa akeekiitee? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Ayaw gooppe, k'umay asaa uluwaa giddo geliide, karew kesiyaawaappe attin, asaa wozanaa giddo gelenna» yaageedda. Hawaadankka Yesuusi k'umaa ubbay tuna gidennawaa erisseedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>K'aykka Yesuusi hawaadan yaageedda; «Asaa tunissiyaabay asaa wozanaa giddoppe kesiyaabaa. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Ayaw gooppe, asaa wozanaa giddoppe kesiyaawe iita k'ofaa; woshummiyaawaa; wuu"iyaawaa; wod'iyaawaa; c'aaratetsaa; <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>yoratetsaa; uuziyaa woy barena dosiyaawaa; iitatetsaa woy c'immiyaawaa; geniyaa; mac'c'awaa amottiyaawaa; k'anaatiyaawaa; boriyaawaa woy zigiriyaawaa; ayyuwaa; eeyatetsaa. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Ha iitabay ubbay asaa wozanaa giddoppe kesiide, asaa tunissee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Itti Giriike Mishiratti Ammanuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat. 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesuusi hewaappe aggiide, S'iiroosanne Sidoonaa giyaa katamatuwaa matan de'iyaa gadiyaa biide, itti golliyaa geleedda; k'ay I yaan de'iyaawaa ooninne eranawaa koyyibeenna; shin k'osettiide gam"anaw danddayibeenna. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Shin bare guutsa naatti bolla iita ayyaanay de'iyaa itti mishiratta Yesuusabaa sisaade, ellekka aakko yaanne Aa gediyaan guufanna aggaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>He mishiratta Ayihuda asaa gidukku; Aa yeletteeddawekka Sooriyaa giyaa gadiyaanna; Aa bare naattippe s'alahiyaa kessana mala, Yesuusa woossaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Shin Yesuusi zaariide, «Naanay kasetiide k'umaa kallino; ayaw gooppe, naanaa k'umaa akkiide, kanatoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kanatoo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalaa itti itti Ayihude asay, Ayihude gidenna asatoo go"etiyaawaa.</char></note> oliyaawe lo"a gidenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Mishiratta zaaraade, «Tumakka ta Godaw, haray atto samppaa miyyiyaan de'iyaa kanatuukka naanatuwaappe atteedda suuppaa miino» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yesuusi k'ay izo, «Ha neeni haasayeedda k'aalaa diraw, s'alahii ne naattippe keseedda; simmi ne soy ba» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Mishiratta bare soy biyaa wode, izi naattippe s'alahii kesina, hiis'an giseeddawunno demmaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Tullenne Duude Gideedda Itti Bitaniyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yesuusi S'iiroosa gadiyaappe kesiide, Sidoonaannanne Tammu Katamaa giyaa gadiyaanna kantsiide, Galiilaa Abbaakko beedda. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Asay tullenne duude gideedda bitaniyaa Yesuusakko ahiide, bare kushiyaa Aa bollan wotsana mala, Yesuusa woosseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesuusi barekka he bitaniyaa c'ora asaappe gas'aa kessiide, bare birad'd'iyaa Aa haytsaan yeddeedda; k'ay c'uchchaa c'uchchiide, Aa ins's'arssaa bochcheedda. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Saluwaa pude s'eelliide, tookki shemppiide, «Eftahi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eftahi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalay Yesuusi ha alamiyaan de'iidde tamaarissiyaa wode, go"ettiyaa Aramaayike yaagettiyaa k'aalaan haasayeeddawaa.</char></note> yaageedda; hewaa giyaawe dooyetta giyaawaa. <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Bitaniyaa haytsay ellekka dooyetti aggeedda; k'ay Aa haasayenna ins's'arssaykka biletti aggeedda; bitanii ayinne waayettennan haasayii aggeedda.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesuusi asaw, «Hawaa oossinne odoppite» yaagiide odeedda; shin I darssi minisi odina, Asay k'ay oduwaa yaa darisseedda. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Hewaa siseedda Asay ubbay daro maalalettiide, «Ubbabaakka I loytsi ootsee. Haray atto tulliyaakka sissee; k'ay duudiyaakka haasayissee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Oyddu Sha"a Asaa Mizeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat. 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>He wode, c'ora Asay k'ay Yesuusakko shiik'eedda; asaw miyaabay d'ayina, Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta barekko s'eesiide, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>«Ha c'ora Asay taananna heezzu gallassay gakkanaw gam"iide, miyaabaa ayinne demmibeenna diraw, taani unttunttoo k'arettay. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Taani unttuntta koshaanna soy yeddooppe, biidde ogiyaan daaburiide kunddana; ayaw gooppe, ittuu ittuu haako saappe yeedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu zaariide, «Ha Asay bayinna saan ha asaa ubbaa mizanaw gidiyaa k'umaa demmanaw danddayiyaawe oonee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttoo aappun daabbuu de'ii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Unttunttu, «Laappu daabbuu de'ee» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Yesuusi asaa, «Sa'aan uttite» yaagiide azazeedda; k'ay laappu daabbuwaa akkiide, S'oossaa galateedda; he daabbuwaa mentsiide, asaw gishana mala, barena kaalliyaawanttoo immeedda. Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu he c'ora asaw gisheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Unttunttoo k'aykka amareeda suuppaa moletuu de'iino; Yesuusi hewanttookka S'oossaa galatiide, asaw gishana mala, barena kaalliyaawantta azazeedda. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Asay ubbay miide kallina atteedda dokkay laappu zambbeeliyaa kumeeddawaa Aa kaalliyaawanttu dentseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>K'umaa meedda Asay oyddu sha"a gidana; hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi asaa yeddeedda. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>I k'ay barena kaalliyaawanttunna ellekka wonggiriyaan geliide, Dalmmanutaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dalmmanutaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe erettenna sa'aa.</char></note> giyaa gadiyaa beedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Parisaawatuu Barenttoo Malaatay Oosettana Mala Oochcheeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat. 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Parisaawatuu yiide, Yesuusanna palumaa doommeeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:11">Yesuusa paac'c'anaw koyyiide, saluwaappe malaataa barentta bessana mala oochcheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesuusi darssi tookki shemppiide, «Ha wodiyaa Asay ayaw malaataa koyyii? Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; ha wodiyaa asaw malaatay ubbaakka imettenna» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>K'ay unttuntta hewaan aggiide, zaari wonggiriyaan geliide, abbaappe hefintsa pinneedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Parisaawatuwaa Irshshuwaanne Heroodisa Irshshuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat. 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu k'umaa afanawaa dogeeddino; unttunttoo wonggiriyaa giddon itti ukitsaappe haray baawa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttentta erite; Parsaawatuwaa irshshuwaappenne Heroodisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Heroodisa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawe Heroodise Anttip'aasa geetettiyaa wogga Heroodisa geetettiyaawaa na'aa.</char></note> irshshuwaappe naagettite» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Unttunttu barenttu giddon, «I hawaa giyaawe nuw k'umay baynna diraassa» yaagiide haasayaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesuusi unttunttu giyaawaa eriide, «Hinttenttoo daabbuu bayinnawaa ayaw haasayiitee? Ha"i gakkanaw hinttew gelennee? Woy akeekikkitee? Hintte wozanay jolleeddee? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Hinttenttoo ayfii de'ee; be'ikkitee? K'ay haytsay de'ee; sisikkitee? Hinttenttoo hassayettennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Erm. 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Hiz. 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Taani ichcheshu daabbuwaa ichcheshu sha"a asaw mentsa immeedda wode, aappun zambbeeliyaa kumeedda dokkaa dentseedditee?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Unttunttu, «Tammanne laa"u zambbeeliyaa kumeedda dokkaa dentseeddo» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>«Taani k'aykka laappu daabbuwaa oyddu sha"a asaw mentsaade immeedda wode, aappun zambbeeliyaa kumeedda dokkaa dentseedditee?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Unttunttu, «Laappu zambbeeliyaa kumeedda dokkaa dentseeddo» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>I k'ay, «Ha"ikka akeekibeykkitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Beetesaydan Itti K'ook'aa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Yesuusinne Aa kaalliyaawanttu Beetesayda giyaa katamaa beeddino; asatuu k'ook'a bitaniyaa Yesuusakko ahiide, he bitaniyaa bochchana mala, Aa woosseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesuusi k'ook'a bitaniyaa kushiyaa oyk'k'iide, heeraappe gas'aa kesseedda; Aa ayfiyaan c'uchchiide, bare kushiyaa Aa bolla wotsiide, «New ayentto beettii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Bitanii d'ok'k'iide, «Taani asaa be'ay; shin Asay hamettiidde, mitsaa malatee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi shirettiide bitaniyaa ayfiyaan bare kushiyaa wotseedda. Aa ayfii pas'eedda; bitaniikka loytsi s'eelleedda; k'ay ubbabaakka geeshshiide be'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesuusi bitaniyaa, «Heeraa geloppa» yaagi Aa soy yeddeedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosa Ammanuwaanne Aa Markkatetsaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat. 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk'. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna K'iisaariyaa Piliip'p'oosa de'iyaa k'eeri heeratuwaa beedda; I biishshin ogiyaan Yesuusi, «Taana Asay oona gii?» yaagiide barena kaalliyaawantta oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu, «Itti itti Asay neena, ‹S'ammak'iyaa Yohaannisa› gee; haranttu, ‹Eelaasa› giino; k'ay haranttu, ‹Nabatuwaappe ittuwaa› giino» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hintteshi taana oona giitee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">P'es'iroosi, «Neeni Dooretteedda Kiristtoosa» yaagiide zaareedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Yesuusi, «Tabaa oossinne odoppite» yaagiide unttuntta azazeedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Gakkana Metuwaabaanne <optbreak/>Waayiyaabaa Koyruwaa Haasayee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat. 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk'. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta, «Taani, Asaa Na'ay, darii waayettanaw bessee; c'imatuu, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu taana is's'anaw bessee; unttunttu taana wod'anawunne taani heezzentsiyaa gallassaappe guyyiyaan, hayk'uwaappe denddanaw bessee» yaagiide tamaarissuwaa doommeedda. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Hewaa I unttunttoo geeshshiide odeedda; P'es'iroosi Aa itti bagga zaariide, zoretaa doommeedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Shin Yesuusi guyye simmiide, barena kaalliyaawantta s'eelliide P'es'iroosa, «Ha Sees'aanaw, kichcha ta matappe! Neeni Asay k'oppiyaawaa k'oppaasappe attin, S'oossay k'oppiyaawaa gidenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kaalussay Oochchiyaa Gatiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:38-39">Mat. 10:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">16:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk'. 9:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Yesuusi c'ora asaanne barena kaalliyaawantta barekko s'eesiide, «Taana kaallana koyyiyaa uray de'ooppe, barena kaddo; yaatiide bare mask'k'aliyaa tookkiide, taana kaallo. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Ayaw gooppe, bare shemppuwaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Shemppuwaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giriikiyaa k'aalaan izaawa woy asaa shemppuwaa geetetti biletteedda.</char></note> ashshana koyyiyaa uray bayizzanawaa; shin ta dirawunne wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa diraw bare shemppuwaa bayizziyaa uray ashshanawaa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Itti uray sa'aan de'iyaa ubbabaa barew shiishshiide, bare shemppuwaa bayizzooppe, Aa ayaa maaddanee? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Itti uray bare shemppuwaa wozanaw ayaa immana danddayi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>S'oossaa ammanenna ha nagaranchcha yeletaa wodiyaan, itti uray taananinne ta k'aalaan yeellatooppe, taanikka, Asaa Na'ay, k'ay ta Aawuwaa bonchchuwaan geeshsha kiitanchchatuwaanna yiyaa wodekka, aan yeellatana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Malay Laametteeddawaa Odiyaa Taarikiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat. 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk'. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; amareeda asatuu S'oossaa kawutetsay wolk'k'aanna yiyaawaa be'ennaan hayk'k'ennawanttu hawaan de'iino» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Yesuusi usuppun gallassaappe guyyiyaan, barenanna P'es'iroosa, Yaak'oobanne Yohaannisa akkiide, unttunttu s'alalaa wolk'k'aama deriyaa bolla kesseedda; unttunttu sintsaan laametteedda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 P'es'. 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Aa mayuukka p'ooleedda; sa'aan mayuwaa meec'c'iyaa ooninne geeshshanaw danddayennawaa keenaa darii boos's'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>He heezzu Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu, Eelaasinne Muse Yesuusanna haasayiyaawantta be'eeddino.<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>P'es'iroosi Yesuusa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, nuuni hawaan de'iyaawe nuw lo"a; nuuni heezzu daasatuwaa ittuwaa new, ittuwaa Musew, k'ay ittuwaa Eelaasaw kees's'ana» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>I waaganenttonne eribeenna; ayaw gooppe, ikka yekkonttukka darii yayyeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, shaarii yiide unttuntta kammina shaariyaappe, «Hawe taani siik'iyaa ta Na'aa; I giyaawaa sisite» giyaa k'aalay yeedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Ellekka unttunttu yuushshi aatsi s'eelliyaa wode, Yesuusappe attin, haraa oonanne barenttu matan be'ibeykkino.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Unttunttu deriyaappe wod'd'ishin, Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani, Asaa Na'ay, hayk'uwaappe denddana gakkanaw, hintte be'eeddabaa oossinne odoppite» yaagiide azazeedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>I azazeeddawaa unttunttu, « ‹Eeno› giide, ha hayk'uwaappe denddiyaawaa giyaawe waagiyaawee» yaagiide, barenttu giddon haasayetteeddino.<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Unttunttu Yesuusa, «Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu ayaw, ‹Eelaas kasetiide yaanaw bessee› giinoo?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>I zaariide yaageedda; «Tumakka, Eelaas kaseti yiide, ubbabaa giigissee; yaatina, ayaw S'oossaa Mas'aafay, ‹Asaa Na'ay darii waayettananne is's'ettana› yaagii? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Shin taani hinttenttoo oday; Eelaas yeedda; k'ay aabay S'oossaa Mas'aafan s'aafetteeddawaadankka, Asay Aa bare koyyeeddabaa ootseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Iita Ayyaanay Oyk'k'eedda Na'aa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat. 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk'. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Yesuusi, P'es'iroosi, Yaak'oobinne Yohaannisi yekko Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttukko simmiide yiyaa wode, c'ora Asay he kaalliyaawanttu yuushshuwaan ek'k'eeddawaanne higgiyaa tamaarissiyaa amareeda asatuu unttunttunna palumettiyaawantta be'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>He c'ora Asay Yesuusa be'eedda wode maalaletti dagammiide, ellekka aakko wos's'i yiide, Aa saroteedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta «Unttunttunna ayaa palumettiitee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>He c'ora asaa giddoppe itti bitanii zaariide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, ta na'aa bollan haasayaa diggiyaa iita ayyaanay de'iyaa diraw, Aa neekko akkaade yaad. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Ha iita ayyaanay Aa oyk'k'iyaa wode ubbaan, Aa olee; Aa doonaannakka hoommuu paarottee; k'ay achchaa garc'c'issee; bollaakka zoolissee. Aappe ha iita ayaanaa kessana mala, neena kaalliyaawanttoo odaaddi, shin kessanaw danddaybbeykkino» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Ammanenna ha wodiyaa asaw! Taani hinttenttunna awude gakkanaw de'anee? K'ay hinttenttubaa awude gakkanaw danddayanee? Na'aa taakko haa akki yiite» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Unttunttu na'aa aakko aheeddino; he iita ayyaanay Yesuusa be'iide elekka na'aa kokkorssii aggeedda; na'ay sa'aan kunddiide, doonaana hoommuu goppu giishshin gonddoretteedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesuusi he na'aa aawuwaa, «Hawe ne na'aa oyk'k'oodeppe woyssa wode gidanee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Na'aa aabbu, «I na'atetsaan de'iyaa wodiyaappe doommeedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Aa wod'anaw daro wode tamaaninne haatsaan oleedda; shin neeni danddayooppe, nuw k'arettaade nuuna maaddaarikkii» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Neeni danddayooppe gay? Ammaniyaa asaw ubbabay danddayettee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Ellekka na'aa aabbu bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Taani ammanay; shin gujja ammananaadan, taana maaddaarikkii» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesuusi Asay dari dari biyaawaa be'iide, iita ayaanaa, «Na'aa tullenne duude ootseedda ayyaanaw, ha na'aappe kesa gaade neena ta azazay; k'ay zaaretsaade aan geloppa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>He iita ayyaanay waassiide, na'aa darssi kokkorssiide, aappe keseedda. Na'ay hayk'k'eeddawaa malatina, daro asay, «Na'ay hayk'k'eedda» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Shin Yesuusi na'aa kushiyaa oyk'k'iide dentsina, na'ay denddi ek'k'eedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yesuusi soy geleeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Aa kaalliyaawanttu Yesuusa dumma, «Nuuni he iita ayaanaa kessanaw ayaw danddaybeykkoo?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Hewaa malay woossappenne s'oomaappe attin, harabaan kesanaw danddayenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Gakkana Metuwaabaanne <optbreak/>Hayk'uwaabaa Laa'entsuwaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk'. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Unttunttu hewaappe denddiide, Galiilaanna aad'd'iide beeddino; Yesuusi bare de'iyaasaa ooninne erana mala koyyibeenna. <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Ayaw gooppe, I barena kaalliyaawantta «Taana, Asaa Na'aa, Asay asaw aatsiide immananne wod'ana; taani k'ay heezzu gallassaappe guyyiyaan, hayk'uwaappe denddana» yaagiide tamaarissee.<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Shin unttunttoo I giyaawe gelibeenna; k'ay Aa oochchanawukka yayyeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaappe Aad'd'iyaawe Oonee?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk'. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Unttunttu K'ifirinaahooma giyaa katamaa beeddino; soy geleeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi unttuntta, «Ogiyaan ayaa palumettiitee?» yaagiide oochcheedda. <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Shin unttunttu biidde ogiyaan, «Nu giddon nu ubbaappe aad'd'iyaawe oonee?» yaagiide palumetteedda diraw, c'o"u geeddino. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yesuusi uttiide, tammanne laa"u barena kaalliyaawantta s'eesiide unttuntta, «Ooninne sintsaw aad'd'ana koyyooppe, ubbaappe guyye aad'd'iide, he ubbaw k'ooma gidanaw bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Itti guutsa na'aa oyk'k'iide, unttunttu giddon esseedda; he guutsa na'aa idimmiide unttuntta, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>«Hawanttu mala guutsa naanaappe ittuwaa ta suntsan mokkiyaa ooninne taana mokkee; k'ay taana mokkiyaa ooninne taana kiitteeddawaa mokkiyaawaappe attin, ta s'alalaa mokkenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi, «Nubaa Ek'ettenna Uray Nu Bagga» Yaageedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk'. 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohaannisi Aa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, itti Asay ne suntsan iita ayyaanatuwaa kessiyaawaa nuuni be'iide, nu bagga gidenna diraw, Aa diggeeddo» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Shin Yesuusi yaageedda; «Ooninne ta suntsan malaataa ootsiide, ellekka ta bolla iitabaa haasayanaw danddayiyaawe bayinna diraw diggoppite; <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>ayaw gooppe, nubaa ek'ettenna uray nu bagga. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; hintte tawantta Kiristtoosawantta gidiyaa diraw, ooninne hinttenttoo ta suntsan buliyaa haatsaa ushanaw immooppekka, bare gatiyaa akkanawaa.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nagaraa Gaasuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat. 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk'. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>«Taana ammaniyaa ha guutsatuwaappe ittuwaa baletsiyaa oonanne, gaac'c'iyaa wogga wos'aa Aa k'ood'iyaan k'achchiide, abbaan Aa oliyaawe aw lo"a. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44"/>Ne kushii neena baletsooppe, k'ans's'a ola; neeni laa"u kushiyaanna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43-44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hara Geeshsha Mas'aafaa biletsatuu, gus's'unii mule hayk'k'ennasaanne k'ay mulekka to'enna Gaannamiyaa tamaan, yaagee. 9:45, 47 s'eellite.</char></note> k'ay ubbakka to'enna Gaannamiyaa tamaan geliyaawaappe, duus'a kushiyaanna de'uwaa geliyaawe new lo"a. <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44"/><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46"/>Ne gedii neena baletsooppe, k'ans's'a ola; neeni laa"u gediyaanna ubbakka to'enna Gaannamiyaa tamaan yegettiyaawaappe, dooma gidaade de'uwaa geliyaawe new lo"a. <verse eid="MRK 9:45-46"/><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47-48"/>Ne ayfii neena baletsooppe, wooc'a ola; neeni laa"u ayfiyaana ubbakka to'enna Gaannamiyaa tamaan yegettiyaawaappe, itti ayfiyaana S'oossaa kawutetsaa geliyaawe new lo"a.<verse eid="MRK 9:47-48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>«K'umaan mas'iniyaa yeggiyaawaadan, tamay asaa ubbaa bolla yegettana. <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Mas'inii lo"a; shin I mal"ana d'ayooppe, zaariide Aa wooti mal"etsanitee? Hinttenttun mas'inii de'o;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:50 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hinttenttun mas'inii de'o: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay Yesuusan ammaniyaawanttu barenttu ammanuwaappe denddo gaasuwaan unttunttu bolla metuu gakkinttokka ittuu ittuwaanna sarotetsaan de'anaw bessee.</char></note> yaatiide ittuu ittuwaanna sarotetsaan de'ite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Machchatto Yeddanaw Bessena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-2">Mat. 19:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk'. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yesuusi hewaappe denddiide, Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsa baggana Yihudaa gadiyaa beedda. C'ora Asay shirettiide aakko shiik'ina, kase I ootsiyaawaadankka he asaa tamaarissuwaa doommeedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Itti itti Parisaawatuu paac'c'anaw Yesuusakko yiide, «Itti Asay bare machchatto yeddanaw nuw higgii azazii?» yaagiide Aa oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>I zaariide, «Muse hinttentta waagi azazeeddee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Unttunttu, «Muse, ‹Itti Asay bare machchatto paramaa immiide yeddo› geedda» yaageeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Zar. 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Hinttenttu odina sisennawantta gidiyaa diraw, Muse ha azazuwaa hinttenttoo s'aafeedda. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Shin S'oossay koyro med'd'iyaa wode, attuma asanne mac'c'a asaa ootsiide, unttuntta med'd'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Dom. 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Hewaa diraw, itti Asay bare aabbanne bare daayo aggiide, bare machchattinna ittuwaa gidee; <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>unttunttu laa"atuu itti asho gidiino; hewaa diraw, unttunttu itti asaa gidiyaawaappe attin, laa"u asaa gidikkino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Dom. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Hewaa diraw, S'oossay ittippe gatseeddawaa Asay shaakkoppo» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Unttunttu soy simmeedda wode, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu ha yewuwaabaa Yesuusa zaari oochcheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Bare machchatto yeddiide, hararo akkiyaa uray ooninne izinna woshummee. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>K'ay mac'c'awunakka bare asinaappe kesaade hara asinaa gelooppe woshummaw» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Guutsa Naanaa Anjjeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk'. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Yesuusi guutsa naanaa bochchana mala, itti itti Asay naanaa aakko aheedda; shin Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu he asaa seereeddino. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yesuusi hewaa be'iide, barena kaalliyaawantta hank'k'etteedda; unttuntta, «Guutsa naanay taakko yiyaawantta diggoppite; ayaw gooppe, S'oossaa kawutetsay hawanttu malaasa. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; S'oossaa kawutetsaa guutsa na'aadan akkena uray ooninne he kawutetsaa ubbakka gelenna» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Guutsa naanaa idimmiide, bare kushiyaa unttunttu bolla huup'iyaan huup'iyaan wotsiide, unttuntta anjjeedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miishshaa Siik'ussay Ahiyaa Metuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk'. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Yesuusi baanaw keseedda wode, itti bitanii wos's'iidde yi Aa sintsan gulbbatiide, «Lo"o tamaarissiyaawoo, med'inaa de'uwaa laattanaw taani ayaa ootsoo?» yaagiide Aa oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesuusi, «Ayaw taana lo"oo gay? S'oossaa s'alalaappe attin, hara lo"uu ooninne baawa. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>S'oossaa azazuwaa, ‹Wod'oppa; woshummoppa; wuu"oppa; wordduwaa markkattoppa; c'immoppa; ne aabbanne ne daayo bonchcha› yaagiyaawaa eraasa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kes. 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Zar. 5:16-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Bitanii Yesuusa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, taani hewaa ubbaa na'atetsaappe doommaade ha"i gakkanawukka naagay» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesuusi bitaniyaa doseedda; Aa c'addi s'eelliide, «New ittibay pac'c'eedda; baade new de'iyaabaa ubbaa zal"aade, he miishshaa hiyyeesaw imma; neeni saluwaan durettana. Yaatowaappe guyyiyaan yaade taana kaala» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Shin bitanii hewaa sisiide, I daro dure gidiyaa diraw, bare som"iyaa d'umissiide, nashettennan aggiide beedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta yuushshi aatsi s'eelliide, «Daro dure Asay S'oossaa kawutetsaa gelanaw waan metanddeeshsha!» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu Aa haasayaa sisiide maalaletteeddino; shin Yesuusi k'aykka unttuntta, «Naatoo, S'oossaa kawutetsaa gelanaw wooti metanddeeshsha!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wooti metanddeeshsha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa itti itti biletsay barew de'iyaabaan ammanettiyaa asaa yaagee.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Dure Asay S'oossaa kawutetsaa gelanawaappe, gaaluu marppiyaa s'oo'iyaanna aad'd'anawe matattee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu maalalettiide, «Yaatina, oonee attanaw danddayiyaawe?» yaagiide ittuu ittuwaa oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesuusi unttuntta c'addi s'eelliide, «Hawe S'oossaw danddayettiyaawaappe attin, asaw danddayettenna; ayaw gooppe, S'oossaw ubbabaykka danddayettee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>P'es'iroosi Yesuusa, «Be'a; nuuni nubaa ubbaa aggiide, neena kaalleeddo» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesuusi, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; ta dirawunne wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa diraw, golliyaa woy ishatuwaa woy michchatuwaa, woy aawuwaa woy aatto woy machchatto, woy naanaa woy gadiyaa aggeeda Asay ooninne, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>ha"i ha wodiyaan s'eetu dakkuwaappe dariyaa golletuwaa, ishatuwaa, michchatuwaa, aatto, naanaa, gadiyaa, k'ay metuwaakka akkanawaa. Sintsappe yaana wodiyaankka med'inaa de'uwaa akkanawaa. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Shin c'oratuu ha"i sintsan de'iyaawanttu guyye aad'd'ana; k'ay c'oratuu ha"i guyyen de'iyaawanttu sintsaw aad'd'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Gakkana Metuwaabaanne <optbreak/>Hayk'uwaabaa Heezzentsuwaa Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk'. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Unttunttu Yerusaalame biidde, ogiyaan de'iino; Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttuppe sintsanna hamettee. Unttunttu maalaletteeddino; Aa kaalliyaawanttu yayyeeddino. Zaariide tammanne laa"u barena kaalliyaawantta gas'aa kessiide, barena gakkanabaa dummayiide unttunttoo hawaadan yaagiide odeedda; <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>«Be'ite; nuuni Yerusaalame ha"i kesoytte; yaan taana, Asaa Na'aa, k'eesatuwaa kaappatoonne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttoo aatsiide immana. Unttunttu ta bollan hayk'uwaa pirddaa pirddana; k'ay ayihuda gidenna asawukka taana aatsiide immana. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>He Ayihuda gidenna Asay ta bolla k'iliic'ananne c'uchchana; taana lissuwaan shoc'ananne wod'ana; taani k'ay heezzu gallassaappe guyyiyaan, hayk'uwaappe denddana.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaak'oobinne Yohaannisi Woosseedda Woosaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat. 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Zabddiyoosa naanay Yaak'oobinne Yohaannisi Yesuusakko yiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, nuuni neena woossiyaabaa ubbabaa nuw ootsaarikkii» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo ayaa ootsoo?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Unttunttu Aa, «Ne bonchcho kawutetsaan neeni uttiyaa wode, nuuppe ittuwaa neeppe ushechcha baggana k'ay ittuwaa haddirssa baggana utissaarikkii» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Shin Yesuusi unttuntta, «Hinttenttu ayaa woossanaw bessinttokka erikkita; taani ushanaw bessiyaa metuwaa s'uu'aa ushanaw danddayiitee? K'ay taani s'ammak'ettanaw bessiyaa s'ink'k'ataa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">S'ink'k'ataa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay Yesuusa gakkeedda metuwaa s'uu'aa guussaa.</char></note> s'ammak'ettanaw danddayiitee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Hewaappe guyye unttunttu zaariide, «Ee danddayeetto» yaageeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesuusi k'ay, «Taani ushanaw bessiyaa metuwaa s'uu'aa hintte ushana; taani s'ammak'ettanaw bessiyaa s'ink'k'ataakka hintte s'ammak'ettana. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Shin taappe ushechcha baggannanne haddirssa baggana uttanawantta dooriyaawe taana gidikke; shin he sa'ay S'oossay immanaw giigissi wotseeddawanttussa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Yekko tammu Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu hewaa siseedda wode, Yaak'oobanne Yohaannisa hank'k'etteeddino. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Yesuusi unttuntta ubbaa barekko s'eesiide, hawaadan yaageedda; « ‹Ayihuda gidennawantta mooddiyaawantta› giide k'oppiyaawanttunne hewantta kaaletsiyaa asatuu barenttu asaa mooddiyaawaa eriita. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Shin hintte giddon hewaa mala gidenna; hintte giddon woggatana koyyiyaa ooninne hinttenttoo k'oomaa gidanaw bessee. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>K'ay hintte giddon ubbaappe bolla gidana koyyiyaa ooninne hintte ubbaw ayile gidanaw bessee. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Ayaw gooppe, haray atto taani, Asaa Na'aykka, asaw ootsanawunne c'oratuwaa wozanaw yeeddawaappe attin, Asay taw ootsana mala yabeykke» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi K'ook'aa Bars's'amoosa Ayfiyaa Patseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk'. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Unttunttu Iyarkko giyaa katamaa beeddino; Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunnanne c'ora asaana Iyarkkoppe kesishshin, S'imoosa na'ay k'ook'ay, Bars's'amoosa giyaawe, ogiyaa doonaan woossiidde utteedda. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Bars's'amoos Naazireetiyaa Yesuusa gideeddawaa sisiide, bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Daawite na'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Daawite na'aa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihude asatuu S'oossaan Okettowe Daawite zeretsaappe yelettanawaa yaagiide k'ooppiyaa diraw, S'oossaan Okettowe «Daawite na'aa» yaagetti s'eesettee.</char></note> Yesuusaa, taana maaraarikkii!» yaagussaa doommeedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>C'ora Asay Aa, «Hayzza!» giide hank'k'etteedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:48">Shin, I bare kooshshaa kasewaappekka darssi d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Daawite na'aw, taana maaraarikkii!» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesuusi ogiyaan ek'k'iide, «Aa haa s'eesite» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Unttunttu k'ook'aa, «Ayinne baawa; dendda ek'k'a; neena s'eesee» yaagiide s'eeseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>K'ook'ay bare mayuwaa oli aggiide, guppi denddi ek'k'iide, Yesuusakko beedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Taani new ayaa ootsanaw koyyay?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">K'ook'ay, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, taani s'eellanawaa koyyay» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesuusi Aa, «Ba; ne ammanuu neena patseedda» yaageedda. Ellekka Aa ayfii s'eelli aggina, ogiyaan Yesuusa kaalli aggeedda.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Wolk'k'aama Bonchchuwaan Yerusaalame Geleedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk'. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Unttunttu Yerusaalame matiidde, Debre Zayite Deriyaa matan de'iyaa Beetefaagenne Biitaaniyaa gakkeeddino; Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttuppe laa"uwaa sintsaw kiittiide, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>«Hinttenttuppe sintsan de'iyaa heeraa biite; yaa gelosaanna ooninne ubbaa toggibeenna k'ashuwaan de'iyaa hare maraa hintte demmana; Aa billi haa akkiide yiite. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Ooninne hinttentta, ‹Hewaa ayaw ootsite?› yaagiide oochchooppe, ‹Godaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Godaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay hariyaa godaa.</char></note> hawe koshshee; ellekka zaari haa yeddanawaa› yaagite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Unttunttu biide, hare maraa penggiyaa matan ogiyaan k'achchi wotseeddawaa demmiide billeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Hewaan ek'k'eedda itti itti asatuu unttuntta, «Hare maraa wootanaw billiitee?» yaageeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu Yesuusi barentta azazeeddawaa odina, asatuu yeddi aggeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Unttunttu hare maraa Yesuusakko ahiide, barenttu mayuwaa Aa zokkiyaan wotseeddino; Yesuusi he hare maraa toggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>C'ora Asay barenttu mayuwaa ogiyaan hiis'eedda; k'ay haranttuu mitsaa haytsaa kar kariide, ogiyaan hiis's'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Yesuusappe sintsanna hamettiyaa asaynne Aa geeduwaa kaalliyaa Asay barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«S'oossay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:9">Godaa suntsan yiyaawe anjjetteeddawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Maz. 118:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Godaa suntsan yiyaa nu aawuwaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:10">Daawite kawutetsay anjjetteeddawaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Saluwaa ubbaappe bolla saluwaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:10">de'iyaa S'oossay galatetto»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:10">yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesuusi Yerusaalame biide, Geeshsha Golliyaa geleedda; k'ay ubbabaa yuuyyi yuuyyi s'eelleeddawaappe guyyiyaan, sa'ay k'ammiyaa diraw, tammanne laa"u Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttunna Biitaaniyaa beedda.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Shek'k'eedda Balasiyaa Mitsatto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat. 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Wonttetsa gallassi unttunttu Biitaaniyaappe kesiide biishshin, Yesuusi koshatteedda. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Haakuwaan itti balasiyaa giyaa mitsatto haytsaa mayya utteeddawunno be'iide, ooni eri I bolla ayfii beettooppenne giide, be'anaw izikko beedda; shin izikko I biyaa wode, haytsaa s'alalaappe attin, ayinne ayfiyaa demmibeenna; ayaw gooppe, balasii ayfiyaa wodii gakkibeenna. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Yesuusi he balasatto, «Neeppe shirettiide med'inaw ooninne ayfiyaa mooppo» yaageedda. Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu I giyaawaa siseeddino.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan Zal"iyaawantta Kesseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk'. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Unttunttu Yerusaalame beeddino; Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaa geliide, hewaan zal"iyaawanttanne shammiyaawantta kare yederssuwaa doommeedda; k'ay miishshaa laammiyaawanttu s'arap'p'eezaanne dogommuwaa zal"iyaawanttu oydiyaa aatsi yeggiide, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>ooninne ayentto tookkiide, Geeshsha Golliyaa gibbiyaa giddonna aad'd'anawaa diggeedda. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Yesuusi asaa hawaadan yaagiide tamaarisseedda: «S'oossaa Mas'aafan, ‹Ta gollii Ayihuda gidenna Asay ubbay S'oossaa woossiyaa golle geetettana› yaagettiide s'aafeetti utteedda; shin hintte Aa bonk'k'anchchatuu k'osettiyaa gonggoluwaa kesseeddita.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erm. 7:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu hewaa sisiide, Aa wod'ana ogiyaa koshshaa doommeeddino; shin c'ora Asay I tamaarissiyaawaan maalalettiyaa diraw, aw yayyeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Sa'ay omarsseedda wode, Yesuusinne Aa kaalliyaawanttu katamaappe gas'aa keseeddino.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balasiyaa Giyaa Mitsatta Melaaddu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat. 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Unttunttu wonttetsa gallassi guura ogiyaanna aad'd'iidde, he balasatta s'ap'uwaanna mela diggeeddawunno be'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>P'es'iroosi hassayiide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, be'a; neeni shek'k'eedda balasatta mela diggaaddu» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesuusi zaariide, unttuntta hawaadan yaageedda; «S'oossaa ammanite. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; ooninne bare wozanaan sid'ennaan bare geeddabay hananawaa ammaniide, ha deriyaa, ‹Denddaade abbaan kundda› gooppe hanana. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Hewaa diraw, S'oossaa hintte woossiyaabaanne oochchiyaabaa ubbaa akki diggowaadan ammanite; hintte akkana. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>S'oossaa woossanaw hintte ek'k'iyaa wode, saluwaan de'iyaa hintte Aawuu hintte nagaraa atto gaana mala, ooninne hinttentta naak'k'eeddabay de'ooppe, aw atto giite. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Shin asaa nagaraa hintte atto gaana d'ayooppe, saluwaan de'iyaa hintte Aawuukka hintte nagaraa hinttenttoo atto geena.»<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Ayaa Maattaani Ootsii Giyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk'. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Unttunttu k'aykka Yerusaalame beeddino; Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan hamettishshin, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu, Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne c'imatuu Yesuusakko yeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>Aa, «Neeni hawaa ootsanaw new ay maatay de'ii? Woy new ha maataa immeeddawe oonee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Taanikka hinttentta ittibaa oochchana; taw odite; taani k'ay hawaa ay maataan ootsaytantto, hinttenttoo odana. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Yohaannisi s'ammak'iyaa maataa akkeeddawe S'oossaappeeyye woy asaappee? Taw odite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Unttunttu barenttu giddon palumaa doommiide, «Nuuni, ‹S'oossaappe yeedda› yaagooppe, I nuuna, ‹Yaatina, Yohaannisi odeeddawaa ayaw ammanibeykkitee?› yaagana. <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Shin, ‹Asaappe yeedda gaanee?› » yaageeddino; k'ay Asay ubbay Yohaannisi nabiyaa gideeddawaa eriyaa diraw, asaw yayyeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Hewaa diraw, unttunttu Yesuusaw, «Nuuni erokko» yaagiide zaareeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesuusi, «Taanikka hawaa ay maataan ootsaytantto, hinttenttoo odikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Woynniyaa Turaa Tokkiyaa Oosanchchatuwaa Leemisuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk'. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Yesuusi unttunttoo oduwaa leemisuwaan yaagiide doommeedda; «Itti bitanii woyniyaa giyaa turaa tokkiide, dirssaa yuushshi aatsiide direedda; k'ay he woyniyaa gumi"iyaa ollaakka bookkeedda; hewaa naagiyaa asaw naagiyaasaa kees's'eedda; hewaappe guyyiyaan, kotsaa ootsiyaa asaw immiide, hara gade beedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isa. 5:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Woynniyaa ayfiyaa mas'iyaa wodii gakkina, barena gakkiyaawaa akkiide yaana mala, itti k'oomaa bare kotsaawatuwaakko kiitteedda. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Kotsaa ootsiyaawanttu Aa k'oomaa oyk'k'i wad'd'iide, kushe mela yeddeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Laa'entsuwaa hara k'oomaa unttunttukko kiitteedda; unttunttu he k'oomaa huup'iyaa p'alk'k'iide pokkissi yeddeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Woynniyaa turaa goday k'aykka hara k'oomaa kiitteedda; he k'oomaa wod'eeddino; k'ay hara c'oratuwaakka hewaadan ootseeddino; ittuwaa ittuwaa wad'd'iide, haratuwaa wod'eeddino.<verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>«Woynniyaa turaa godaw kiittanaw ubbaappe wurssetsaan I darii siik'iyaa Aa na'aa s'alalay atteedda; I, ‹Unttunttu ta na'aa bonchchennaan aggikkino› giide, bare na'aa unttunttukko kiitteedda.<verse eid="MRK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>«Shin kotsaa ootsiyaawanttu barenttu giddon, ‹Laattanawe hawaa; biide Aa wod'oytte; aw de'iyaawe nuwaa gidana!› yaageeddino. <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Na'aa oyk'k'i wod'iide, Aa anhaa woyniyaa turaa giddoppe gas'aa kessi oleeddino.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>«Simmi woyniyaa turaa goday wootanee? Yiide he kotsaawatuwaa wod'i wurssiide, woyniyaa turaa kotsaa ootsiyaa hara asaw immanawaa.<verse eid="MRK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10-11"/>« ‹Gimbbiyaawanttu kad'i is's'eedda shuchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10-11">godaa s'ap'uwaa minisiyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10-11">ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa shuchchaa gideedda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10-11">Hawe Goday ootseeddawaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10-11">k'ay nuunakka maalalissiyaawaa›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10-11">yaagiyaawaa S'oossaa mas'aafaappe nabbabi beykkitee?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:10-11">yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Maz. 118:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:10-11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuu, higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne c'imatuu Yesuusi he leemisuwaa barenttun leemiseeddawaa ereedda diraw, Aa oyk'k'anaw koyyeeddino; shin asaw yayyiide, bashi beeddino.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Giiraa Giiranee Agganee Giyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk'. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>K'ay Aa haasayaappe balaa demmana mala, Parisaawatuwaappenne Heroodisa baggatuwaappe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Heroodisa baggatuwaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawantta guussay he wode de'iyaa kawutetsaa polottikaa baggana kase wogga Heroodisanne Aa na'aa Herood Anttip'aasa baggatuwaanne unttuntta kaalliyaa asatuwaa.</char></note> amareedawanttu aakko kiittina yiide, <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>«Tamaarissiyaawoo, neeni tumuwaa haasayiyaawaanne asaappe asaa shaakkennawaa nuuni ereetto; ayaw gooppe, neeni asaa dummayakka; k'ay S'oossaa ogiyaa tumatetsaan tamaarissaa. Nuuni Roomaa Kaatiyaa K'eesaarew giiraa giiriyaawe wogeeyye woga gidennee? Giiraa giiraneeyee digganee?» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Shin unttunttu lo"a malatiyaa iita asaa gideeddawaa Yesuusi eriide, «Taana ayaw paac'c'iitee? Itti santtimiyaa haa taakko ahite; taani ane be'ana» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Unttunttu aw aheeddino; «Ha malaynne suntsay oowee?» yaagiide unttuntta oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Unttunttu, «K'eesaarewaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Yaatooppe, K'eesaarewaa K'eesaarew, S'oossaawaa S'oossaw immite» yaagina unttunttu aabaa maalaletteeddino.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hayk'uwaappe Dendduwaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk'. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Hayk'k'eedda Asay denddenna giyaa Saduk'aawanatuwaappe itti itti asatuu Yesuusakko yiide, hawaadan yaagiide, Aa oochcheeddino; <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>«Tamaarissiyaawoo, Muse nuw higgiyaa s'aafiidde, ‹Machchatto akkeedda Asay na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'ooppe, he hayk'k'eeddawaa ishay Aa machchatto laattiide, bare ishaw na'aa yelanaw bessee› yaagiyaawaa s'aafeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Zar. 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Itti wode laappu ishatuu de'iyaawanttuppe bayiray machchatto akkiide, na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Laa'entsiyaa ishay izo akkeedda; ikka na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'eedda; heezzentsiyaawekka hewaadan haneedda. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Laappunatuukka izo akkiide, na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'eeddino; ubbaappe guyyiyaan, k'ay he mishiratta hayk'k'aaddu. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Yaatina, hayk'k'eedda Asay hayk'uwaappe denddiyaa wode, iza unttunttuppe hak'awoo machche gidanee? Ayaw gooppe, laappunatuukka izo akkeeddino».<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesuusi zaariide unttuntta, «Hinttenttu balettiyaawe, S'oossaa Mas'aafatuwaanne Aa wolk'k'aa erenna diraassa! <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Ayaw gooppe, hayk'k'eedda Asay hayk'uwaappe denddiyaa wode, saluwaan de'iyaa kiitanchchatuwaa mala gidanaappe attin, attuma asaynne akkena; mac'c'a asaynne gelenna. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Shin hayk'k'eeddawanttu dendduwaabaa gidooppe, Muse mas'aafan s'aafetteedda s'aragay miyaa buuraabaa odiyaa sa'aan, S'oossay Musa, ‹Taani Abraahaame S'oossaa, Yisaak'a S'oossaa, Yaak'ooba S'oossaa› gidiyaawaa ubbakka nabbabi beykkitee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kes. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>I pas'a de'iyaawanttu S'oossaa gidiyaawaappe attin, hayk'k'eeddawanttu S'oossaa gidenna; hintte darssi baleeddita» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaappe Aad'd'iyaa Azazuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat. 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk'. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttuppe ittuu unttunttu palumettiyaawaa shiik'iide siseedda; k'ay Yesuusi unttunttoo lo"o zaareeddawaa sisiide, «Azazuwaa ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa azazuu hak'awee?» yaagiide Yesuusa oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesuusi zaariide, Aa «Azazuwaa ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa azazuwaa, ‹Israa'eeliyaa Asay sisite, Goday nu S'oossay itti Godaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Zar. 6:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Hinttenttu Godaa hintte S'oossaa hintte kumentsaa wozanaappe, hintte kumentsaa shemppuwaappe, hintte kumentsaa k'ofaappe, hintte kumentsaa wolk'k'aappe siik'ite› yaagee. <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>K'ay azazuwaa ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa laa'entso azazuu hawaa; ‹Neeni ne shooruwaa ne huup'iyaadan siik'a› giyaawaa; hawanttuppe aad'd'iyaa hara azazuu baawa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wog. 19:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawe Yesuusa yaageedda; «Tamaarissiyaawoo, tumuwaa gaadda; neeni ‹S'oossay itti S'oossaa s'alala. Aappe attin, haray baawa› geeddawe tuma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Zar. 4:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>S'oossaa kumentsaa wozanaappe, kumentsaa k'ofaappenne kumentsaa wolk'k'aappe dosiyaawenne k'ay bare shooruwaakka bare huup'iyaadan siik'iyaawe, guuddiyaa yarshshuwaappenne hara yarshshuwaa ubbaappe aad'd'ee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesuusi higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawaa zaaruu aad'd'o eranchcha asaa zaaruwaa gideeddawaa be'iide, «Neeni S'oossaa kawutetsaappe haakkabeykka» yaageedda; hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusa harabaa oochchanaw ooninne s'alibeenna.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">«Yesuusi O Na'ee» Yaagiyaa Ooshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-46">Luk'. 20:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan tamaarissiidde, «Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu Kiristtoosa wooti Daawite na'aa giinoo? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Daawite barena Geeshsha Ayyaanay haasayissina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">« ‹Goday ta Godaa, «Taani ne morkkatuwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">neeni yed'd'a ek'k'iyaabaa ootsana gakkanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">hawaan taappe ushechcha baggana, bonchchettaade utta» geedda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 12:36">yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Daawite bare huup'ew Kiristtoosa, ‹Godaa› giide s'eesooppe, yaatina, Kiristtoosi waaniide, Daawite na'aa gidii?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">C'ora Asay Yesuusi giyaawaa nashechchaan siseedda.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi, «Muse Higgiyaa Tamaarissiyaawanttuppe Naagettite» Yaageedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk'. 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Yesuusi tamaarissiidde, «Higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttuppe naagettite; unttunttu adussa mayuwaa mayyiide yuuyyiyaawaanne geyaa heerankka Asay unttuntta bonchchiidde sarotiyaawaa dosiino. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Unttunttu Ayihuda woosa golletuwaan darii lo"iyaa oydiyaa dosiino; k'ay Asay barentta imatsatetsaan mokkiyaasankka bonchcho sa'aa dosiino. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Unttunttu am"etuu golliyaa bonk'k'iidde, barenttoo lo"a malatanaw S'oossaa woosaa adussiino; unttunttu ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa muraa akkanawantta» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am"atti Mis'uwaataa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk'. 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaan imotaa yeggiyaa saas'iniyaa matan uttiide, Asay bare miishshaa he saas'iniyaan yeggiyaawaa be'eedda; c'ora dure Asay daro miishshaa he saas'iniyaan yeggeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Itti hiyyeesaa am"atta yaade, itti santtimiyaan laamettiyaa laa"u sembberatuwaa he saas'iniyaan yeggaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta s'eesiide, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa gay; imotaa saas'iniyaan yeggeedda asaa ubbaappe ha hiyyeesaa am"atta darissaade yeggaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Ayaw gooppe, haratuu ubbay barenttoo palaheedda miishshaappe yeggeeddino; shin iza bare pac'aappe, barew de'iyaa de'uwaa mulekka imma aggaaddu» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geeshsha Gollii Kolettanawaa Kasetiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk'. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaappe kesishshin, Aa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu Aa, «Tamaarissiyaawoo, hawe aybe lo"o shuchchatenttonne k'ay aybe lo"o shuchchaa gollatuwaa be'ay!» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ha wolk'k'aama shuchchaa gollatuwaa be'ay? Ha gollatuwaan de'iyaa itti shuchchaynne attenaan ubbay kolettana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Goday Yaanaappe Kasetiide Gakkana Yederssuwaanne Waayiyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk'. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Golliyaappe hini baggana Debre Zayite Deriyaa bollan utteedda wode, P'es'iroosi, Yaak'oobi, Yohaannisinne Inddiraasi barenttu s'alala aakko yiide Aa, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>«Hewe awude hananentto, nuw odaarikkii; k'ay hewe ubbay polettana wodiyaa erissiyaa mallatuu ayaa gidanee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesuusi k'ay unttunttoo hawaadan yaagiide, oduwaa doommeedda; Hinttentta ooninne baletsena mala naagettite. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>C'ora asatuu ta suntsan, «Taani Kiristtoosa» yaagiidde yaanawaa; c'ora asaa baletsana. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Matan de'iyaa olaa kooshshaanne haakuwaan de'iyaa olaa oduwaa hintte sisiyaa wode, hirggoppite; hewaa malabay hananaw bessee; shin wurssetsay biraa. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Ayaw gooppe, itti gade Asay hara gade asaana olettana; k'ay itti kawutetsay hara kawutetsaanna olettana; biittaa k'aatsay ubba saan de'ana; koshaykka de'ana; shin hewe koyro yeluwaa oytsaa mala.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Shin hintte hinttenttu huup'ew naagettite; ayaw gooppe, Asay hinttentta oyk'k'iide, pirddaa gollew aatsiide immana; k'ay bare Ayihuda woosa golletuwankka hinttentta lissuwaan shoc'ana; gadiyaa mooddiyaawanttu sintsaaninne kaatatuwaa sintsan ta diraw hintte markkattanaw ek'k'ana. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Mishiraachchuwaa k'aalay koyronna asaw ubbaw odetti digganaw bessee. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Unttunttu hinttentta pirddaa golle ahiyaa wodenne aatsiide immiyaa wode, wooti haasayanitentto koyronna hirggoppite; he saatiyaan S'oossay hinttenttoo immiyaabaa haasayite. Ayaw gooppe, Geeshsha Ayyaanay haasayanaappe attin, haasayiyaawanttu hinttentta gidikkita.<verse eid="MRK 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Ishay bare ishaa, aawuu bare na'aa wod'isana; k'ay naanay barenttu aawotuwaa bollaninne barenttu aayetuwaa bolla denddiide, unttuntta wod'isana. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Asay ubbay hinttentta ta suntsaa diraw is's'ana; shin wurssetsay gakkanaw genc'c'iyaawe attana.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalame Gakkana Wolk'k'aama Iita Metuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat. 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk'. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>Shin nabiyaa Daaneel odeedda bashshaa tunatetsay ek'k'anaw bessenasan ek'k'ishshin hintte be'iyaa wode, hewe waagiyaawentto, nabbabiyaawe akeeko; Yihudaa gadiyaan he wode de'iyaawanttu deriyaakko betino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan. 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Golliyaa huup'iyaan de'iyaa uraykka ittibaa akkanaw duge wod'd'iide, bare soy geloppo. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Gaden de'iyaawekka bare mayuwaa akkanaw guyye simmoppo. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>He wode shahaara mac'c'awanttoonne d'antsiyaa mac'c'awanttoo aayyeero. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Shin hawe ubbay haniyaa wodii balgguwaa gidenna mala, S'oossaa woossite; <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>ayaw gooppe, S'oossay sa'aa koyro med'd'eeddawaappe doommiide, ha"i gakkanaw, ubbakka de'ibeenna metuu, k'ay hawaappe sintsawukka ubbaa de'enna metuu asaa bolla he wode de'ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Sas'. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Goday he gallassatuwaa payduwaa guutsiyaawe baawentto, asaa gideedda ooninne attena; shin I bare dooreedda asatuwaa diraw, he gallassatuwaa payduwaa guutseedda.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>He wode ooninne hinttentta, «Be'ite; Kiristtoosi hawaan de'ee» woy, «Be'ite; Kiristtoosi, hewaan de'ee» yaagooppe, hewaa ammanoppite. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Ayaw gooppe, worddanchcha Kiristtoosatuunne worddo nabatuu denddiide barenttoo danddayettooppe, haray atto S'oossay dooreeddawanttakka baletsanaw malaataanne maalalissiyaabaa bessana. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Shin hintte naagettite; taani hinttenttoo ubbabaa kasetaade odaaddi.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa Laa'entso Yuussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk'. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>Shin he wode he waayiyaappe guyyiyaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">away d'umana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">agenay poo'iyaawaa aggana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Iyu. 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Sas'. 6:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>S'oolinttatuu saluwaappe kunddana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">K'ay saluwaan de'iyaa wolk'k'atuukka k'aas'ettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa. 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Iyu. 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Sas'. 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>He wode taani, Asaa Na'ay, wolk'k'aama wolk'k'aannanne bonchchuwaanna shaariyaa giddonna yiishshin, unttunttu be'ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Sas'. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>He wode taani kiitanchchatuwaa sa'aa oyddu bagga kiittana; sa'aa gas'aappe saluwaa gas'aa gakkanaw, S'oossay dooreedda asaa shiishshana.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wodiyaa Wurssetsay Gakkeeddawaa<optbreak/> Malaataa Bessiyaa Balasiyaa Mitsatto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk'. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>Leemisuwaa balasatto giyaa mitsattippe tamaarite; balasatta aac'iya wodenne izi haytsay hayttiyaa wode, bonii mateeddawaa hintte eriita. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Hawaadankka hintte he ubbabay haniyaawaa be'iyaa wode, I<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">I: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusa guussaa.</char></note> matattiide penggiyaa shiik'eeddawaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Matattiide penggiyaa shiik'eeddawaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay, Yesuusa yuussay mateedda guussaa.</char></note> erite. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; ha ubbabay hanana gakkanaw, ha wodiyaa yeletay hayk'k'idiggenna. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Saluunne sa'ay aad'd'ana; shin ta k'aalay ubbakka aad'd'enna.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetsa Gallassaanne Saatiyaa Ooninne Erenna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat. 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>Shin he gallassaanne he saatiyaa Aawuwaa s'alalaappe attin, haray atto saluwaan de'iyaa kiitanchchatuwaa gidina, woy taana Na'aa gidinakka ooninne eriyaabay baawa. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>He wodii awude gidanentto, hintte erenna diraw, naagettite; minnite; S'oossaa woossite. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Ta yuussay bare golliyaa aggiide, ogiyaa biyaa bitaniyaa mala; bitanii bare k'oomatoo huup'iyaan huup'iyaan oosuwaa immiide, unttuntta bare oosoo kaappo ootseedda; k'ay kariyaa naagiyaawekka minisiide naagana mala azazeedda.<verse eid="MRK 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Hewaa diraw, minnite; ayaw gooppe, golliyaw omarssa gidina, woy k'amma bilahe gidina, woy kuttuu waassiyaa wode gidina, woy guura wonttumaatsaan gidina awude yaanentto, hintte erikkita. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Hinttenttu akeekenaan I yooppe, hinttentta gem"isheeddawantta demmenna mala minnite. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Taani hinttenttoo odiyaawaa asaa ubbaw oday; minnite.<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa Bolla Mak'k'etteeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk'. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Paasigaa Baalaa giyaawaa bonchchiyaa gallassaynne C'aalibeenna ukitsaa muussaa bonchchiyaa baalaa gallassay gakkanaw laa"u gallassay atteedda; k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu Asay erennaan Yesuusa oyk'k'iide wod'ana ogiyaa koyyiino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kes. 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>«Asay walassaa kessenna mala, Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassi hewaa ootsokko» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Shittuwaa Okkeedda Mishiratto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesuusi Biitaaniyaa gadiyaan oolluwaa harggiyaa Simoona soyin k'umaa maanaw utteedda wode, itti mishiratta albass's'iroosa baaretaa kumeedda narddoosa giyaa darii al"o shittuwaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Darii al"o shittuwaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay loytsi sawiyaawaa guussaa.</char></note> akkaade yaaddu; he albbass's'iroosa baareeta mentsaade shittuwaa Yesuusa huup'iyaan tigaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4-5"/>Hewaan de'iyaa asaappe ittuu ittuu hank'k'ettiide, «Ha shittuwaa c'oo ayaw bayizzay? Ha shittuwaa heezzu s'eetu biraa santtimiyaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Biraa santtimiyaa: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:37">6:37</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'eellite.</char></note> zal"iide, miishshaa hiyyeesaw immanaw danddayettee» yaagiide barenttu giddon haasayiino; yaatiide he mishiratto darssi hank'k'etteeddino. <figure style="fig" alt="Alabaster jars" file="hk00142b.tif" size="col" ref="14:3-5">Albbass's'iroosa Baareetaa</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:4-5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Shin Yesuusi hawaadan yaageedda; «Ha mishiratto ayinne gooppite; izo ayaw metootsiitee? Iza taw lo"obaa ootsaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Hiyyeesatuu ubbaa wode hinttenttunna de'iino; hintte koyyeedda wode awudenne unttuntta maaddanaw danddayiita; shin taani ubbaa wode hinttenttunna de'ikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Zar. 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Iza barew danddayetteeddawaa ootsaaddu; k'ay ta asatetsay moogettanaappe kasetaade moogoo giigissanaw shittuwaa okkaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; sa'aa ubbaan wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odiyaasan hak'aninneekka, Asay izo k'oppana mala, ha iza ootseeddawe odettana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu Yesuusa <optbreak/>Aatsiide Immanaw Zoretaa Eeno Geedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk'. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Tammanne laa"u Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:19">3:19</ref> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'eellite.</char></note> giyaawe, Yesuusa k'eesatuwaa kaappatoo aatsiide immanaw unttunttukko beedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Unttunttu hewaa siseedda wode nashettiide, «Nuuni new miishshaa immana» yaageeddino; Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu Yesuusa aatsiide immanaw injjetiyaa wodiyaa wochchee.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Barena Kaalliyaawanttunna <optbreak/>Paasigaa K'umaa Meedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk'. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>C'aalibeenna ukitsaa miyaa baalaa gallassaa bonchchiyaa koyro gallassi, Paasigaa k'umaa maanaw dorssaa shukkiyaa wode, Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu Aa, «Paasigaa bonchchiyaa gallassi neeni maana k'umaa nuuni hak'a biide giigissanee?» yaagiide oochcheeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttuppe laa"atuwaa hawaadan yaagiide kiitteedda; «Katamaa biite; hintte biishshin, otuwaan haatsaa tookkeedda itti bitanii hinttenttunna gakettanawaa; Aa kaallite. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>I biide geliyaa golliyaawuwaa, ‹Tamaarissiyaawe neena, «Taani taana kaalliyaawanttunna Paasigaa k'umaa maanaw ta imatsaa kifilii hak'anee?» yaagee› yaagite. <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Golliyaawuu hinttentta pook'iyaa bollan de'iyaa giigi utteedda aako kifiliyaa bessana; hewaan nuw giigissite» yaageedda. <figure style="fig" alt="Two-story house with steps toroof" file="lb00235b.tif" size="span" ref="14:15">Pook'iyaa Golliyaa</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>He laa"u Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu kesiide, katamaa beeddino; Yesuusi barenttoo odeeddawaadankka ubbabaa demmiide, Paasigaa k'umaa giigisseeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Sa'ay omarssiyaa wode Yesuusi tammanne laa"u barena kaalliyaawanttunna yaa beedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Unttunttu uttiide samppaappe k'umaa miishshin, Yesuusi unttuntta, «Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; hinttenttuppe ittuu taananna miyaawe, taana aatsiide immanawaa» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu loytsi sisettina, huup'iyaan huup'iyaan Aa, «Tumu taaneeshsha?» giyaawaa doommeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «I ha hinttenttu tammanne laa"atuwaappe ittuwaa; I taananna ittippe tushanaw bare daabbuwaa shaataan yeddiyaawaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Taani, Asaa Na'ay, S'oossaa mas'aafay hayk'k'ana geeddawaadan hayk'k'ana; shin taana, Asaa Na'aa, aatsiide immiyaa uraw aayyeero; he uray yelettennaan atteeddentto, aw lo"a shin» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godaa Kawuwaa Akkiyaa Wogaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk'. 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 K'or. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Unttunttu miishshin, Yesuusi daabbuwaa akkiide, S'oossaa galateedda; he daabbuwaa mentsiide, barena kaalliyaawanttoo immiidde, «Heytte; hawe ta ashuwaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>S'uu'aa akkiide, S'oossaa galatiide, unttunttoo immeedda; ubbay he s'uu'aappe usheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Yesuusi, «Hawe ooratsa c'aak'uwaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ooratsa c'aak'uwaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">S'oossay bare asaw Yesuusa hayk'uwaa baggana k'aalaa geleedda ooratsa k'aalaa c'aak'uwaa. Hewenneekka Aa gakkiyaa s'uu'aa, I bare suutsaa gussiide aatsi immeedda Aa de'uwaa. Hewenneekka, nu ec'a asatetsay ubbay laamettina, ooras's'eedda S'oossaa higgii nu wozanaan s'aafetteeddawaa odee.</char></note> c'ora asaa diraw gukkiyaa ta suutsaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kes. 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erm. 31:31-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Taani hinttenttoo tumuwaa oday; taani S'oossaa kawutetsaan ooratsa woyniyaa eessaa ushana gallassay gakkanaw, laa'entsuwaa ha woyniyaa eessaa ubbakka ushikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Mazimuriyaa yes's'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Debre Zayite Deriyaa beeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosi Kaddanawaa Yesuusi Kasetiide Odeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk'. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">«Hinttenttu ubbay taana yeggiide wos's'anita; ayaw gooppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">S'oossaa Mas'aafay, ‹S'oossay dorssaa heemmiyaawaa wod'ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">hewaappe guyyiyaan dorssay ubbay laalettana gee›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 14:27">yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zak. 13:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Shin taani hayk'uwaappe denddeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, hinttenttuppe kasetaade Galiilaa baana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>P'es'iroosi zaariide, «Unttunttu ubbatuu neena yeggiide booppekka, taani neena mulekka yeggikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesuusi P'es'iroosa, «Taani new tumuwaa oday; hachche k'amma kuttuu laa'entsuwaa waassanaappe kase, neeni taana heezzu gede kaddanaassa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Shin P'es'iroosi kasewaappekka minisiide, «Taani haray atto, neenanna ittippe hayk'k'inttokka, neena mulekka kaddikke» yaageedda. K'ay haratuu ubbatuukka hewaadan geeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geetesemaaniyaan Woosseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk'. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Geetesemaane giyaa sa'aa beeddino; Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawantta «Taani S'oossaa woossanaw, hinttenttu hawaan uttishshite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Yesuusi P'es'iroosa, Yaak'oobanne Yohaannisa barenanna afeedda; darii kayyotteeddanne metooteedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>K'ay unttuntta, «Taani hayk'k'ana gakkanawukka kayyottay; hawaan takkishshite; gem"ishoppite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Guutsaa sintsakko shiik'iide, sa'aan guufanniide, danddayettiyaawaa gidooppe, he wodii bareppe aad'd'ana mala, S'oossaa woosseedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>K'aykka, «Abbabboo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abbaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay Giriike k'aalankka «Abbaa» gidiyaa wode, Aramaayike k'aalaani «Aabba» giyaawaa.</char></note> ta Aabboo, ubbabay new danddayettee; ha s'uu'aa taappe digga; shin ne sheniyaadan hanoppe attin, ta sheniyaadan hanoppo» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttukko simmi yiide, gem"isheeddawantta demmiide P'es'iroosa, «Simoonaa, gem"ishshaaddii? Neeni itti saatenttonne naaganaw danddayabeykkii? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Paac'iyaan hintte gelenna mala, naagettitenne S'oossaa woossite; ayyaanay giigi utteedda; shin ashuu daaburanchcha» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>K'aykka biide kasewaadankka S'oossaa woosseedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttukko guyye simmiide I yiyaa wode, gem"isheeddawantta demmeedda; unttunttu ayfiyaa gem"ishuu goozi wotseedda diraw, aw ayaa haasayiinonttokka eribeykkino.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Heezzentsuwaa unttunttukko yiide, «Ha"i gakkanawukka gem"ishiiteenne shemppiitee? Gidana; wodii gakkeedda; be'ite, taana, Asaa Na'aa, nagaranchcha asatuwaa kushiyaan aatsiide immiyaa wodii gakkeedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Denddina boytte; be'ite, taana aatsiide immiyaawe haweku gakkeedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Bare Morkketuwaa Kushiyan Oyk'etteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk'. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Yesuusi hewaa biro haasayishshin, tammanne laa"u Aa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuu, Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu, ellekka gakki wod'd'eedda; k'ay k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttunne c'imatuu kiittina, mashshaanne s'am"aa oyk'k'eedda c'ora Asay aanana ittippe yeedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Yesuusa aatsi immiyaawe he c'ora asaw, «Taani yeriyaawe Aa; Aa oyk'k'iide loytsi naagiide, afite» yaagiide mallaa odi wotseedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Yihudaa Ask'k'orootu gakkosaannakka Yesuusakko shiik'iide, «Tamaarissiyaawoo» yaagiide Yesuusa yeri akkeedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>He c'ora Asay Yesuusa minisi oyk'k'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Shin matan ek'k'eeddawanttuppe ittuu bare c'ubiyaa shoddinne k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa k'oomaa shoc'iide, Aa haytsaa k'ans's'i oleedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesuusi zaariide, he shiik'eedda c'ora asaa, «Taana bonk'k'anchcha kessiide, bonk'k'anchchaa oyk'k'iyaawaadan oyk'k'anaw c'ubiyaanne s'am"aa oyk'k'iide yeedditee? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Taani Geeshsha Golliyaan tamaarissaadde, gallassan gallassan hinttenttunna de'iyaa wode taana oyk'k'ibeykkita; shin S'oossaa Mas'aafatuu geeddawe polettanaw bessee» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu ubbatuu Aa yeggiide bi aggeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Nas'alaa s'alalaa mayyeedda itti yalaga bitanii Yesuusa kaalliyaawaa Asay oyk'k'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>Shin he bitanii nas'alaa oliide, kallo s'iira wos's'eedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Pirddiyaa Shanggatuwaakko Afeeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat. 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk'. 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Asay Yesuusa k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa soy, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuwaa ubbatuu, c'imatuunne higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawanttu shiik'eeddasaa afeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>P'es'iroosi k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa dirssaa gidduwaa gakkanaw haakuwaan Aa kaalleedda; yaan naagiyaawaanna tamaa kashiidde, utti aggeedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne hewaan shiik'eedda Asay ubbay Yesuusa wod'anaw Aa bolla markkaa koyyeeddino; shin ayinne demmibeykkino. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Ayaw gooppe, c'ora asatuu Aa bollan wordduwaa markkatteeddino; shin unttunttu markkatetsay itti mala gidenna.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57-58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57-58"/>Itti itti asatuu denddi ek'k'iide Yesuusa bolla, «I, ‹Taani Asay kees's'eedda ha Geeshsha Golliyaa kolaade, Asay kees's'ibeenna hara Geeshsha Golliyaa heezzu gallassaa giddon kees's'ana› giishshin, nuuni siseeddo» yaagiide wordduwaa markkatteeddino. <verse eid="MRK 14:57-58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Shin haray atto unttunttu markkatetsay hewaan itti mala gidibeenna.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuu asaa ubbaa sintsan denddi ek'k'iide Yesuusa, «Hawanttu neena mootiyaa mootoo new zaariyaabay baawee?» yaagiide oochcheedda. <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Shin Yesuusi c'o"u giide, ayinne zaaribeenna; k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuu Aa, «Anjjetteedda S'oossaa Na'ay Kiristtoosi neenee?» yaagiide laa'entsuwaa oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesuusi zaariide, «Ee, taana; hintte taana, Asaa Na'aa, wolk'k'aama S'oossaappe ushechcha baggana uttide'ishshinanne saluwaa shaariyaanna yiishshin be'ana» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>K'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuu bare mayuwaa peed'i oliide, «Nuuna hawaappe sintsan ayaw hara markkaa koshshii? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Hinttenttu Aa boriyaa siseeddita; hintte k'ofay ayee?» yaageedda; unttunttu ubbay, «I hayk'k'ana bessee» yaagiide Aa bolla pirddeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Wog. 24:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Unttunttuppe ittuu ittuu Aa bolla c'ushetsaa doommeeddino; Aa ayfiyaa kammi dechchiide, «Neena dechcheeddawe oonee? Ane timbbitiyaa oda!» yaageeddino; k'ay naagiyaawanttukka Aa k'ins's'alliyaa bak'k'iidde afeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'es'iroosi Yesuusa Kaddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat. 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk'. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>P'es'iroosi dirssaa giddon hirkkinna de'ishshin, k'eesatuwaa ubbatuwaa kaappuwaa mac'c'a k'oomatuwaappe ittinna yaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>P'es'iroosi tamaa kashiyaawaa be'aade, c'adda s'eellaade, «Neenikka Naazireetiyaa Yesuusanna ittippe de'aa» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Shin P'es'iroosi, «Neeni giyaawe ayentto taani erikke; taw akeeketenna» yaagiide kaddeedda; yaatiide dirssaa penggiyaakko keseedda; kuttuukka waasseedda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kuttuukka waasseedda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalay beni biletteedda itti itti biletsaan baawa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>He k'oomata P'es'iroosa be'aade, Aa matan ek'k'eedda asatuwaa, «Ha bitaniikka unttunttunna de'ee» gaade gujjaade oduwaa doommaaddu. <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Shin P'es'iroosi k'aykka kaddeedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Guutsaa gam"ishin, matan ek'k'eedda asatuu laa'entsuwaa P'es'iroosa, «Neeni tuma unttunttunna ittippe de'aa; ayaw gooppe, neeni Galiilaa gadiyaa asaa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Shin P'es'iroosi, «Taani hewaa hintte giyaa bitaniyaa erikke!» yaagiide barena shek'aanne c'aak'uwaa doommeedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Ellekka kuttuu laa'entsuwaa waassi aggeedda; P'es'iroosi barena Yesuusi, «Neeni kuttuu laa'entsuwaa waassanaappe kase heezzu gede taana kaddanaassa» geeddawaa hassayiide, darii yeekkeedda.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa P'ilaas'oosakko Afeeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk'. 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Wontta guuran ellekka k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu c'imatuwaannannee Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawaanttunna hewaan shiik'eedda Ayihuda shanggatuwaa ubbaanna mak'k'ettiide, Yesuusa k'achchi afiide, P'ilaas'oosaw aatsiide immeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>P'ilaas'oosi Aa, «Neeni Ayihudatuwaa kaatee?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesuusi zaariide Aa, «Ne giyaawaadana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>K'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Yesuusa daroban mooteeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>P'ilaas'oosi shirettiide Yesuusa, «New zaariyaabay baawee? Unttunttu ne bolla woyissa mootuwaa ahintto be'ikkii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Shin Yesuusi harabaa zaarennaan is's'ina, P'ilaas'oosi maalaletteedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Bolla Hayk'uwaa Pirddeeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk'. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoh. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>P'ilaas'oosaw Paasigaa Baalaa bonchchiyaa gallassaan Asay koyyiyaa itti uraa k'ashuwaappe billiyaa wogay de'ee. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>He wode itti Barbbaana giyaa bitanii walassaa kessiide shemppuwaa wod'eedda asatuwaana ittippe k'asho golliyaan de'ee. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Shiik'eedda c'ora Asay P'ilaas'oosi kase erettowaadankka barenttoo maarotaa ootsana mala, Aa oochcheeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>P'ilaas'oosi asaa zaariide, «Taani hinttenttoo Ayihudatuwaa kaatiyaa billiyaawaa koyyiitee?» yaagiide oochcheedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Ayaw gooppe, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Yesuusa k'anaatiide aatsi immeeddawaa P'ilaas'oosi ereedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Shin k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Yesuusa kotaa Barbbaana billanaadan, he shiik'eedda Asay P'ilaas'oosa woosana mala, asaa mak'k'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>P'ilaas'oosi laa'entsuwaa zaariide, «Yaatina, ha Ayihuda kaatiyaa hinttenttu giyaawaa wootoo?» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Asay P'ilaas'oosaw zaari zaari barenttu kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Aa kak'k'a» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>P'ilaas'oosi asaa, «Ayaw? I ay iitabaa ootseedee?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Shin Asay kasewaappekka bare kooshshaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Aa kak'k'a» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>P'ilaas'oosi asaa nashechchanaw koyyiide, Barbbaana asaw billeedda; yaatiide lissuwaan Yesuusa wotaadaratuwaan shoc'issiide, kak'k'ana mala unttunttoo aatsi immeedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wotaadaratuu Yesuusa K'iliic'eeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat. 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, wotaadaratuu Yesuusa gadiyaa mooddiyaawaa gibbiyaa afiide, hara wotaadaratuwaa ubbaa ittippe s'eeseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>K'ay zo'o mayuwaa Aa mayzzeeddino; aguntsaa kalachchaa giigissiide, Aa huup'iyaan wotseeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Aa, «Ayihudatuwaa kaatew, sarotay new gido» yaagi sarotiidde, Aa k'iliic'uwaa doommeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Yesuusa huup'iyaa mak'k'aa s'am"aan shoc'eeddino; k'ay Aa bollan c'uchcheeddino; gulbbatiide aw goyinneeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Aa bolla k'iliic'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, zo'o mayuwaa aappe k'aari akkiide, Aa mayuwaa Aa mayzzeeddino; yaatiide mask'k'aliyaa bollan misimaariyan d'ishiide, Aa kak'k'anaw afeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Kak'k'eeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk'. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Unttunttu biide, Iskkinddiranne Rufoosa yeleedda aawuwaa, itti Simoona giyaa K'ereena gadiyaa asay, gas'aappe katamaa yiyaawaanna gakettiide, Yesuusa mask'k'aliyaa wolk'k'aan toosseeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom. 16:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Yaatiide Golggootaa geetettiyaasaa Yesuusa afeeddino. «Golggootaa» giyaawe «Huup'iyaa Gosiyaasaa»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">«Huup'iyaa Gosiyaasaa» </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Geetettiyaawe, asaa huup'iyaa malatiyaa shuchchay hewaan de'iyaa diraw, huup'iyaa gosiyaasaa geetetteedda.</char></note> giyaawaa. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Kawaraa giyaa d'alii walaketteedda woyniyaa eessaa Yesuusaw ushanaw immeeddino; shin I ushennaan is's'eedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Unttunttu Aa kak'k'eeddino; k'ay oona oona gakkanentto eranaw Aa mayuwaa shaakkiide, saamaa yeggeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Unttunttu Aa kak'k'iyaa wode, wonttaappe heezzu saate. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>«Ayihudatuwaa kaatiyaa» yaagi Aa mootiyaa s'aafuu s'aafeetti utteedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Yesuusanna laa"u kayisatuwaa ittuwaa aappe ushechcha baggana, k'ay ittuwaa aappe haddirssa baggana mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishiide kak'k'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «Iitabaa ootseedda asatuwaana I paydetteedda» yaagiyaawe poletteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Ogiyaanna aad'd'iyaa Asay Yesuusa kad'iide, barenttu huup'iyaa k'aatsiidde boreeddino; «Simmi, Geeshsha Golliyaa kolaade heezzu gallassaa giddon kees's'iyaawoo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz. 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar. 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>ane mask'k'aliyaa bollappe wod'd'aade, ne huup'iyaa ashsha» yaageeddino.<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Hawaadankka k'eesatuwaa kaappatuu Muse higgiyaa tamaarissiyaawaanttunna ittippe Yesuusa bolla, «Hara asatuwaa ashsheeda; shin barena ashshanaw danddayenna; <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>nuuni be'iide ammanana mala, Kiristtoosi Israa'eeliyaa kaatii, ane mask'k'aliyaa bollappe ha"i wod'd'o» giide k'iliic'eeddino. K'ay haray atto, aanana mask'k'aliyaa bolla misimaariyan d'ishettiide kak'etteeddawanttukka Aa bolla k'iliic'eeddino.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Hayk'uwaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk'. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Usuppun saatiyaappe doommiide, udduppu saatiyaa gakkanaw, gadiyaa ubbay d'umeedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Udduppu saatiyaan Yesuusi bare k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide, «Elohee, Elohee, laamaa sabak'itaanii?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Elohee, Elohee, laamaa sabak'itaanii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha k'aalatuu Yesuusi ha alamiyaan ashuwaa mayyiide simerettiyaa wode haasayettiyaa Aramaayike geetettiyaa k'aalaan haasayettowaa.</char></note> yaageedda. Hewaa giyaawe, «Ta S'oossaw, ta S'oossaw, taana ayaw aggaaddii?» giyaawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Maz. 22:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Hewaan ek'k'eedda asaappe ittuu ittuu hewaa sisiide, «Be'ite; Eelaasa s'eesee» yaageedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>He asaappe ittuu wos's'i yiide, zanzzaa malatiyaawaan c'aala woyniyaa eessaa kuntseedda; hewaa mak'k'aa gatimaa s'eeraan wotsiide, «De'ishshite ane; Eelaas mask'k'aliyaappe Aa wotsanaw yaanenttonne ane be'oytte» yaagiidde Yesuusa doonaakko ushshanaw shiishsheedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Yesuusi k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsi waassiide, hayk'k'i aggeedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Geeshsha Golliyaan k'ashetteedda gaaridduu k'ommoppe duge gakkanaw, laa"u kesiide pooshetti wod'd'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-36">Kes. 26:31-36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Mask'k'aliyaappe sintsa baggana hewaan ek'k'eedda itti s'eetuwaa Kaappuu, hewaa keenaa Yesuusi waassiide hayk'k'eeddawaa be'eedda wode, «Ha bitanii tumu S'oossaa Na'aa» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Hewaan haakuwaan ek'k'iide s'eelliyaa amareeda mac'c'awanttu de'iino; unttunttu giddon Magdala giyaa katamaappe yeedda Mayraama, teefa Yaak'oobanne Yoosa daaya Mayraamanne Salooma de'iino. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>He mac'c'a asatuu Yesuusi Galiilaan de'iyaa wode, Aa kaalleeddawanttanne Aa maaddeeddawantta; k'ay Yesuusanna ittippe Yerusaalame beedda hara c'ora mac'c'a asatuu hewaan de'iino.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Mooguwaabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43"/>Sa'ay omarsseedda wode, hewaan shiik'eedda asaan bonchchetteedda itti Yooseefo giyaa bitanii, S'oossaa kawutetsay yaanawaa naagi utteeddawe, Armmaatiyaasa giyaa katamaa Asay yeedda; he gallassay wonttetsa Sambbataw giigettiyaa gallassaa gideedda diraw, Yooseefo s'aliide P'ilaas'oosakko biide, Yesuusa anhaa akkanaw woosseedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>P'ilaas'oosi, Yesuusi elekka hayk'k'i diggeeddawaa siseedda wode maalaletteedda; s'eetuwaa kaappuwaa s'eesiide, «I hayk'k'oodeppe gam"eeddee?» yaagiide oochcheedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>P'ilaas'oosi Yesuusi hayk'k'eeddawaa s'eetuwaa kaappuwaappe sisiide, Aa anhaa Yooseefo akkanaadan ootseedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yooseefo mooguwaa mayuwaa shammeedda; Yesuusa anhaa mask'k'aliyaappe wotsi mayuwaan s'aas'iide, shuchchaa wooc'eedda asaa moogiyaa gonggoluwaa giddon Aa anhaa wotseedda; k'ay he gonggoluwaa doonaan wolk'k'aama shuchchaa gonddorssiide wotseedda. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Magdala katamaappe yeedda Mayraamanne Yoosa daaya Mayraama Yesuusa anhaa unttunttu hak'an wotsintto be'iino.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Hayk'uwaappe Denddeedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk'. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Sambbatay aad'd'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Magdala katamaappe yeedda Mayraama, Yaak'ooba daaya Mayraamanne Salooma biide, Yesuusa anhaa okkanaw shittuwaa shammeeddino. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Wogaa gallassi wonttumaatsa daro guuran s'alk'k'ii kesishshin, he gonggoluwaa beeddino. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Unttunttu barenttu giddon ittuu ittuwaanna, «Gonggoluwaa doonaappe nuw shuchchaa oonee gonddorssiide digganaweeshsha?» yaagiide haasayiino.<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Unttunttu s'eelliyaa wode, he daro wolk'k'aama shuchchaa gonddorssidiggeeddawaa be'eeddino. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Yesuusi moogetteedda gonggoluwaa giddo geliyaa wode, itti wodalla bitanii bootsa mayuwaa mayyiide, ushechcha baggana utteeddawaa be'iide dagammeeddino.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Shin I unttuntta, «Dagammoppite. Mask'k'aliyaa bolla kak'etteedda Naazireetiyaa Yesuusa hinttenttu koyyiyaawaa eray. I hawaan baawa; denddi diggeedda. Unttunttu Aa wotseeddasaa hawaa be'ite. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Shin biide Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttoonne P'es'iroosaw, ‹Yesuusi hinttenttuppe kasetiide Galiilaa bee; I hinttenttoo odeeddawaadankka hinttenttu Aa yaan be'ana› yaagiide hawaa odite» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Mac'c'a asatuu yashshaan kokkoriidde, Yesuusi moogetteedda gonggoluwaappe kesiide bak'ati aggeeddino; k'ay unttunttu yayyeedda diraw, asaw hewaa oossinne ayinne odibeykkino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">Mac'c'a asatuu biide, barenttoo odetteeddabaa ubbaa P'es'iroosawunne aanana de'iyaawanttoo k'antsaan odeeddino; hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yesuusi bare huup'ew barena kaalliyaawanttu bolla, med'inaw ashshiyaa laamettenna geeshsha mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa, away mokkiyaasaappe wulliyaasaa gakkanaw kiitteedda.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Magdala Mayraamiw Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoh. 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Yesuusi hayk'uwaappe denddeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Wogaa gallassi guura, laappu iita ayyaanatuwaa kesseedda Magdala katamaappe yeedda Mayraamiw kasetiide beetteedda. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Iza baade kase aanana de'iyaawanttoo, k'arettiiddinne yeekkiidde utteeddawanttoo odaaddu; <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>shin Yesuusi pas'a de'iyaawaanne iziw beetteeddawaa unttunttu siseedda wode, Izi oduwaa tuma gibeykkino.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Laa"u Barena Kaalliyaawanttoo Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk'. 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttuppe laa"atuu katamaappe kesiide biishshin, ogiyaan Yesuusi koyrowaappe dummatiide, unttunttoo beetteedda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Unttunttu guyye simmiide, haratoo odeeddino; shin hewanttu unttunttu oduwaa tuma gibeykkino.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Tammanne Itti Barena Kaalliyaawanttoo Beetteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk'. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kit. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Guyyeppe tammanne itti Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttu k'umaa miishshin, Yesuusi unttunttoo beetteedda. Unttunttoo ammanuu baynna diraw, I unttuntta seereedda; k'ay hayk'uwaappe I denddeeddawaa be'eeddawanttu unttunttoo odina, unttunttu ammanennaan is's'eedda dirawunne odina sisennawantta gidiyaa diraw, I unttuntta seereedda.<verse eid="MRK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>I unttuntta hawaadan yaageedda; «Alamiyaa ubbaa biide, asaa ubbaw wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odite. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Ammanowenne s'ammak'ettowe attana; shin ammanennawaa bolla S'oossay pirddana. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Taanan ammaniyaawanttu ha malaatatuwaa ootsanawantta: unttunttu ta suntsan iita ayyaanatuwaa kessanawantta; k'ay unttunttu dumma dumma ooratsa k'aalaan haasayanawantta. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Unttunttu shooshshaa oyk'k'oopekka, woy ayaanne wod'iyaa marzziyaa ushinttokka unttuntta k'ohenna. K'ay unttunttu barenttu kushiyaa hargganchchatuwaa bolla wotsana; he hargganchchatuu pas'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Saluwaa Pude Keseedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk'. 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kit. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Godaa Yesuusi barena kaalliyaawanttunna haasayeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, S'oossay Aa pude saluwaa afina, S'oossaappe ushechcha baggana utteedda. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Aa kaalliyaawanttu biide, ubba saan wonggalaa mishiraachchuwaa odeeddino. Godaykka unttunttunna ittippe ootsee; unttunttu odiyaa k'aalaykka tuma gideeddawaa unttunttu ootsiyaa malaatatuwaan erisseedda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itti itti beni Geeshsha Mas'aafatuwan ha paydatuu baawa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
